04/23/24,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Improper use of your report,Reporting company used your report improperly,"Subject : Request for Immediate Removal of Late Payments from Credit Report Pursuant to Consumer Law To Whom It May Concern, I am writing to request the immediate removal of late payments from my credit report in accordance with consumer law, specifically 15 U.S. Code 1666b, 15 U.S.C. 1681a ( 2 ) ( I ), and 15 U.S. Code 6802. Upon reviewing my credit report, I have identified late payments that are inaccurately reported and must be removed promptly to avoid further harm to my creditworthiness. 

I request the removal of the following late payments : XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX I assert that these late payments are inaccurately reported and violate my rights under consumer protection laws for the following reasons : 1. Violation of Consumer Law : Consumer protection laws, including 15 U.S. Code 1666b, safeguard consumers from unfair credit reporting practices. The reporting of inaccurate late payments on my credit report constitutes a violation of these laws.

2. Accuracy Requirement : According to 15 U.S.C. 1681a ( 2 ) ( I ), consumer reporting agencies are required to ensure the accuracy of the information they report. The inclusion of inaccurate late payments on my credit report fails to meet this requirement.

3. Privacy Protection : 15 U.S. Code 6802 aims to protect consumers ' privacy rights by ensuring the accuracy and confidentiality of their personal information. The reporting of inaccurate late payments compromises my privacy rights and must be rectified immediately.

I demand that you take immediate action to remove the inaccurate late payments from my credit report and provide me with written confirmation of their removal within [ specify a reasonable timeframe, e.g., 10 business days ] days of receipt of this letter.

Thank you for your prompt attention to this matter. Should you require any further information or documentation, please do not hesitate to contact me at the address or phone number provided above. 

Sincerely, XXXX XXXX",None,"EQUIFAX, INC.",NY,11435,None,Consent provided,Web,04/24/24,Closed with non-monetary relief,Yes,N/A,8837773
