04/03/24,Checking or savings account,Checking account,Managing an account,Deposits and withdrawals,"On Friday XX/XX/XXXX, TD Bank wrongfully withdrew funds from my checking account, froze my account and was very difficult and rude when I demanded to know why. In the end there was a subpoena for someone with the same name as me so instead of checking to see if they had the correct person they simply withdrew the funds and froze the account. 
