A branch manager had to try multiple times to get to the right person to unfreeze the account. They didn't even want to unfreeze it as they said we had to go through the lawyers of the company suing the other guy with the same name as me! Why would it be MY responsibility to fix THEIR mistake?? I don't know these lawyers and what if they don't talk to me? 
