03/22/24,Vehicle loan or lease,Loan,Problems at the end of the loan or lease,Unable to receive car title or other problem after the loan is paid off,"In XXXX I leased my XXXX XXXX through XXXX XXXX. In XXXX I decided that I wanted to keep my XXXX and took a loan with Ally financial. At that point they should have had the title transferred from XXXX to them Ally Financial and they never did. They were also responsible for sending the Virginia Dept of Motor Vehicles the sales tax in the amount of {$1000.00} which they did not. In the loan contract attached you will see that my loan with Ally was satisfied and that the taxes in the amount of {$1000.00} were included in the loan but DMV has informed me that they never received the transfer of title from XXXX to Ally or the taxes. I have spent numerous hours on the phone talking to every department. On XX/XX/XXXX, I spent the entire day being transferred from department to department only to continue to not have no resolution. They are telling me I have to go after the car dealer for the taxes but my loan is between me and Ally. There is no other Seller on the sales contract but Ally. Ally is the Seller and lender of the loan which clearly makes Ally responsible to pay the taxes. I just want to sell my vehicle and am unable to do so because of this. I feel as though they have stole money from me at this point. If they will just look through their records to find this check that may help in some way but I can't even get that far with them because they keep telling me they are not responsible when its clear that they are. I really hope that you can help me with this situation because I am getting no where with Ally financial. They are not helping me and this money was paid and satisfied in my loan so they should be the responsible party to pay it but they are telling me that they are not responsible and the only way I can get the title to my vehicle is if they pay the taxes which are owed by them.",Company has responded to the consumer and the CFPB and chooses not to provide a public response,ALLY FINANCIAL INC.,NY,10461,None,Consent provided,Web,03/22/24,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,8604171
