03/19/24,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Problem with a company's investigation into an existing problem,Their investigation did not fix an error on your report,"I have recently discovered inaccuracies in my credit report under my name, XXXX XXXX. 
Specifically, the following information/ accounts are incorrect and need to update : XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX According to the Fair Credit Reporting Act, the following are defined as billing errors that must be corrected : -Disagreements between the purchase price and the price shown on the bill. 
-Charges for products or services not delivered according to the agreement. 
