06/04/24,Student loan,Federal student loan servicing,Improper use of your report,Reporting company used your report improperly,"XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX, Ny XXXX Account : XXXX NELNET ATTENTION : XXXX XXXX. 

XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX, XXXX XXXX AFFIDAVIT OF FACT/ NOTICE Dear XXXX XXXX, I hope this letter finds you in get spirit and good health. 

I am responding to the letter I received on XXXX XXXX. I take this matter seriously. I come with clean and good faith from the being. I was ignorant to the law and my right. Now that Im woke I have the right to exercise. I have previous attempts to resolve this issue. 



Fact, Puarsuant to House Joint Resolution XXXX XXXX XXXX, XXXX. XXXX. CHAPTER XXXX, XX/XX/year> JOINT RESOLUTION - [ H.J. Res. XXXX ] [ Pub. XXXX, XXXX. XXXX ] XXXX XXXX XXXX Every obligation, heretofore or hereafter incurred, whether or not any such provision is contained therein or made with respect thereto, shall be discharged upon payment, dollar for dollar, in any coin or currency which at the time of payment is legal tender for public and private debts. that the government has the obligation to discharge and settle any debts we may incur in our daily lives. There are many ways to skin a cat, but It was says it in your law not mines. 

Im requesting the following QUESTION to Be ANSWER.

1. How is the Evidence is lacks any legitimacy?

2. How all this unfair, deceptive, and misrepresentation practices, lack of performance, lack of consideration and lack of fiduciary duty of Nelnet, is going to fine me?

3. How can one pay a DEBT WITH ANOTHER DEBT.

4. What are the 1099-C IRS FORMS made for?

5. How is the 1099-C IRS FORMS fraudulent?

6. HOW is the Nelnet on my credit report Benefiting ME?

7. Are you Harassing me or threating me?

8. I cant practice my legal right? My equitable rights?

9. Is the United States BANKRUPT?

10. Tell me WHAT are the FALSE STAMENTS, FABRICATING PHYSICAL EVIDENCE?

11. Tell me WHAT SCAM YOU ARE REFERING TO?

12. WHO IS BEING TARGETED?

13. WHAT CONSEQUECES YOU ARE REFERING TO, AM I A CHILD? 





FACT, Pursuant to XXXX XXXX. DISCHARGE AND EFFECT OF DISCHARGE. 

( a ) The obligation of a party to pay the instrument is discharged as stated in this Article or by an act or agreement with the party which would discharge an obligation to pay money under a simple contract. 

( b ) Discharge of the obligation of a party is not effective against a person acquiring rights of a holder in due course of the instrument without notice of the discharge. 





If you have any concern please write me. I look forward to your response. 

Sincerely, By : XXXX ; XXXX",None,"Nelnet, Inc.",NY,10467,None,Consent provided,Web,06/04/24,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,9158672
03/18/24,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Account information incorrect,"RE : You Violated the United States Code Law ( TILA 15 U.S. Code 1666 ( b ) billing error ) Recently I checked my credit report and noticed multiple billing errors under 15 U.S.

Code 1666 ( b ) billing error -The creditor 's mistake in not accurately showing a payment or credit that the consumer made on their account statement.

-A billing error under the Fair Credit Billing Act ( FCRA ) that is caused by a creditor 's computational or accounting mistake. 
Under the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ), creditors are required to provide consumers with at least 21 days ' notice before reporting a late payment. Since I did not receive this notice, I am demanding to see hard evidence from the creditor 's bank account that I did not make the required payment and that the late payment was in error. 
I request that the following items on my credit report be updated to reflect that they were paid as agreed. 
1. This late payment status is irrelevant XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX This account is fully satisfied. Please update this account immediately 2. This late payment status is irrelevant XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX  The late payment in the past was settled. I'm currently on time with my payments. Please update this account immediately 3. This late payment status is irrelevant XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX This account is inaccurate. Please update this account immediately PLEASE SEE THE PROOF ATTACHED TO THIS LETTER Under the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ), I am entitled to have these accounts on this letter updated immediately. If you do not comply, I will file a lawsuit in small claims court in my city and state seeking monetary damages for your violation of my rights. 

