07/15/24,Credit card,General-purpose credit card or charge card,Getting a credit card,Problem getting a working replacement card,"Absolutely the worst consumer experience! 
Greeted with the utmost disrespect. Staff inside the branch yell at customers and are extremely inefficient. Absolutely unacceptable. Unprofessional. 
I frequently expand my collection of credit cards and I applied for the TD Cash Credit Card. They printed me a TD Cash SECURED Credit Card ( in the branch ) and refused to come to a resolution in any way. Dismissed with XXXX figure it out yourself. Cancel your card, not our problem your credit score will go down because of our error. Never had such a terrible experience with any other banks. Staff not trained properly. Bank manager not helpful. 

