04/24/24,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Improper use of your report,Reporting company used your report improperly,"TO WHOM IT MAY CONCER, I am writing to formally dispute a charge-off entry on my credit report, which I believe is inaccurate and not compliant with the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ) and XXXX XXXX compliancy requirements. 

The inaccurate entry is as follows : Acct Name : XXXX XXXX XXXX Account # XXXX Date of Charge-Off : XX/XX/XXXX Acct Name : XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX Acct # XXXX Date of Charge-Off : XX/XX/XXXX Acct Name : XXXX XXXX XXXX Acct XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX Charge-Off : XX/XX/XXXX Acct Name : XXXX XXXX XXXX  XXXX Acct # XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XX/XX/XXXX Acct Name : XXXX XXXX XXXX Acct # XXXX Date Of Charge-Off : XX/XX/XXXX I dispute this entry on the following grounds : 1. XXXX Inaccuracies : Pursuant to the FCRA, creditors are required to report accurate and complete information to credit bureaus. However, the information provided regarding the charge-off is inaccurate. I have not received proper documentation or validation of this debt, and I dispute its validity. 

XXXX. Lack of Notification : The FCRA also mandates that consumers be notified of any negative information reported to credit bureaus. I have not received any notification regarding the charge-off in question, which is a violation of my rights under the FCRA. 

3. XXXX XXXX Compliance : The XXXX XXXX Reporting Guidelines outline specific requirements for the reporting of consumer credit information. I believe that the creditor XXXX have failed to adhere to these guidelines in reporting the charge-off, thereby rendering the entry inaccurate and non-compliant. 

I request that you conduct a thorough investigation into this matter in accordance with FCRA regulations and XXXX XXXX compliancy requirements. If the investigation confirms that the charge-off entry is inaccurate or non-compliant, I request that it be promptly removed from my credit report. 

Please provide me with written confirmation once the investigation is complete and any necessary corrections have been made to my credit report. 

Thank you for your attention to this matter. Should you require any further information or documentation, please do not hesitate to contact me at the address or phone number provided above. 

Sincerely, XXXX XXXX",None,"EQUIFAX, INC.",NY,11435,None,Consent provided,Web,04/24/24,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,8837253
