03/13/24,Credit card,General-purpose credit card or charge card,Problem when making payments,Problem during payment process,"My payment for this Cerulean MasterCard is due on the XXXX of every month. After the XXXX all my payments are late and subjected to penalties ... which I understand. 

Cerulean/Continential Finance received my payments before XX/XX/2024. On XX/XX/2024 I made a {$25.00} payment for the upcoming XXXX payment. On XX/XX/2024 I made a {$25.00} payment towards the XX/XX/2024 payment. On XXXX the XXXX, I made a {$58.00} payment for XX/XX/2024 totalling {$100.00}. 

On XX/XX/XXXX, Cerulean/Continential Finance billed me {$41.00} saying that I was late paying when I had all of my payment in before the XXXX of XX/XX/2024. They also charged me an addition {$36.00} for interest on a purchase. Last month it was {$35.00} for the interest on the same purchase. 

I called they told me they had no payment for the {$25.00} and therefore I was late because my bill was not paid on time. I told them this was not true and I am looking at all my payments for XX/XX/2024. The agent wanted to argue with me. This is the 2nd month in a row that they have been cheating me, and I have had enough of it. 

