05/08/24,Debt collection,Other debt,Written notification about debt,Didn't receive notice of right to dispute,"I sent an email requesting the following information : Can you provide detailed information about the debt being collected, including the original creditor 's name, account number, and the date the debt was incurred? 
How much is the total amount being claimed, and can you provide an itemized breakdown of the charges and fees associated with the debt? 
Can you verify the accuracy of the personal information associated with the debt, such as my name, address, and Social Security number? 
Can you provide documentation or proof of ownership of the debt, such as a copy of the original contract or agreement? 
Have you validated the debt in accordance with the Fair Debt Collection Practices Act ( FDCPA ), including providing verification of the debt upon request? 
Can you provide a detailed history of the debt, including any previous attempts to collect and communications regarding the debt? 
Are there any inaccuracies or discrepancies in the collection report that need to be addressed? 
Can you explain any charges or fees that I don't understand or that seem excessive? 
Have you reported this debt to any credit bureaus, and if so, can you provide information on when it was reported and to which bureaus? 
What steps can I take to resolve any errors or disputes on the collection report, and what is your process for investigating and correcting inaccuracies? 

The email address, along with another alternate email address has my address blocked so I can not communicate with them to resolve the debt after verifying the information of the collection",None,"Aldous & Associates, PLLC",NY,10456,None,Consent provided,Web,05/08/24,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,8959919
