03/30/24,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Improper use of your report,Reporting company used your report improperly,"I am writing to bring to your attention an issue I have discovered upon reviewing my consumer reports. Upon careful examination, I noticed that there are two instances of late payments reported on an account with which I have consistently maintained a flawless payment history. Consumer reporting agencies play a crucial role in accurately reporting consumer information, and it is imperative that this information is conveyed with utmost precision. I have always upheld my financial responsibilities diligently and have never been late on. payments for the account with the indentifier [ XXXX XXXX XXXX Account Number : XXXX ]. I am formally requesting a thorough investigation into these reported late payments. I kindly ask that you provide concrete evidence, such as statements, indicating the alleged late payments. If sufficient proof can not be provided to substantiate these claims, I insist that these payments be promptly updated to reflect their accurate status as "" paid on time. '' Maintaining an accurate credit report is essential for individuals to access fair financial opportunities, and it is my expectation that this matter will be resolved expeditiously and with the utmost attention to accuracy. Thank you for your prompt attention to this matter. I look forward to receiving your response and resolution of this discrepancy. Please keep me updated step by step.",None,"EQUIFAX, INC.",NY,10562,None,Consent provided,Web,03/30/24,Closed with non-monetary relief,Yes,N/A,8659718
