11/14/23,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Information belongs to someone else,"Complaint XXXX The inquiries below were made without my permission or knowledge, and I believe they are negatively impacting my credit score. 

This is the list of the inquiries that I am disputing : Inquiry by XXXX XXXX on XX/XX/2023 - EQUIFAX Inquiry by XXXX XXXX on XXXX XXXX- EQUIFAX I have made several attempts to contact the companies responsible for these inquiries, but they have been unresponsive and have not provided me with any information about why they made the inquiries or whether they have any legitimate reason for doing so. 

I have also tried to dispute these inquiries with the credit reporting agencies, but they have not been able to provide me with a satisfactory explanation for why these inquiries remain on my credit report. 

I believe that these inquiries are unjustified and have no legitimate reason for being on my credit report. They have caused me significant stress and financial hardship, as they have affected my ability to obtain credit and have lowered my credit score. 

I am therefore requesting that the CFPB investigate this matter and take action to remove these inquiries from my credit report. I believe that this action is necessary to protect my rights and ensure that my credit report accurately reflects my creditworthiness.",None,"EQUIFAX, INC.",NY,10453,None,Consent provided,Web,11/14/23,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,7849987
