03/27/24,Credit card,General-purpose credit card or charge card,Problem with a purchase shown on your statement,Credit card company isn't resolving a dispute about a purchase on your statement,I decided to purchase shoes and clothes for my family from this website called XXXX I deposited {$440.00} so I can order the clothes I wanted I wait for agent to submit orders to vendors then finally they ship out my package after paying over {$200.00} for shipping Once my package arrived in the mail and I unpacked everything I noticed right away these shoes have horrible defects glue stains on midsole the soles themselves are coming apart in two pieces I can see where they begin to separate I check the shirts I was sold I noticed the quality was horrible on this XXXX  T shirt I purchased this pair of XXXX XXXX and I find not only did they ship me the wrong pair I needed a size XXXX and I received a size XXXX men so these are unwearable the rest of shoes are horrible they smell like very stinky glue and I decided to wear one of the shoes around the house and right away the make loud squeaky noises I purchased real XXXX shoes and they definitely dont make that noise I was really upset with this haul the quality on all of the goods I ordered were horrible versions of the real non XXXX  shoes I wanted to return these horrible quality shoes but I read online its a nightmare having to return these shoes Id have to pay another {$200.00} to ship these back to XXXX  and I didnt want to break the law by shipping out fake XXXX  items 18 USC 2320 : Trafficking in XXXX  goods or services. So I decided to open a dispute with my credit card provider chase regarding this I explained my entire situation and chase ended up siding with XXXX saying charge was valid after I explained 1 pair of shoes were missing and 2 T shirts on top of fact these are horrible quality fakes I cant possible wear these shoes in public The glue they used makes a squeaky sound when I tried them in my house this is the first and last time I use XXXX and Im upset with chase dispute process with protecting the customer Im honestly thinking of paying off my statement balance and closing the card if chase is unable to assist in disputes XXXX card is heaven sent when it comes with disputes Im not sure why chase doesnt respect their customers I simply just want my money back for these horrible XXXX goods I purchased I cant ship them back because thats against the law and I would have to pay out of pocket {$200.00} if XXXX wants to provide a label and have XXXX pickup the package because I will not get involved with shipping XXXX  goods out the us Please contact chase regarding this dispute its unfair they just close out the dispute on the customer and side with the merchant Unacceptable,None,JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.,NY,10801,None,Consent provided,Web,03/27/24,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,8630988
05/02/24,Checking or savings account,Savings account,Closing an account,Can't close your account,"I called Bank of America to close my accounts. I asked for the agent to email me instructions to close my accounts. He said he could not give me written instructions to close my account. I went to the website and searched for how to close my account. The only available information for closing an account reads, "" We appreciate your business and are sorry to hear you want to close your account. We hope you'll consider speaking with us first so we can address any concerns you might have. Call us at XXXX to share your feedback with us. 

Before proceeding with closure, you might be interested in converting your existing account to a different account or finding a new one. '' I tried to send all of the funds in the account out. It requires me to leave {$50.00} behind for some reason. Asking how to close an account, in writing, seems like a fair request, to reduce the chances of any sort of misunderstanding. Bank of America refused.",Company has responded to the consumer and the CFPB and chooses not to provide a public response,"BANK OF AMERICA, NATIONAL ASSOCIATION",NY,11222,None,Consent provided,Web,05/02/24,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,8907526
