03/18/24,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Account information incorrect,"RE : You Violated the United States Code Law ( TILA 15 U.S. Code 1666 ( b ) billing error ) Recently I checked my credit report and noticed multiple billing errors under 15 U.S. Code 1666 ( b ) billing error -The creditor 's mistake in not accurately showing a payment or credit that the consumer made on their account statement.

-A billing error under the Fair Credit Billing Act ( FCRA ) that is caused by a creditor 's computational or accounting mistake.

Under the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ), creditors are required to provide consumers with at least 21 days ' notice before reporting a late payment. Since I did not receive this notice, I am demanding to see hard evidence from the creditor 's bank account that I did not make the required payment and that the late payment was in error. 
I request that the following items on my credit report be updated to reflect that they were paid as agreed. 
XXXX. This late payment status is irrelevant XXXX XXXX Account Number : XXXX Please correct/update this inaccurate information on my credit report. 

XXXX. This late payment status is irrelevant XXXX XXXX Account Number : XXXX Please correct/update this inaccurate information on my credit report. 

XXXX. This late payment status is irrelevant XXXX XXXX XXXX Account Number : XXXX Please correct/update this inaccurate information on my credit report. 

XXXX. This late payment status is irrelevant XXXX XXXX Account Number : XXXX Please correct/update this inaccurate information on my credit report. 

Under the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ), I am entitled to have these accounts on this letter updated immediately. If you do not comply, I will file a lawsuit in small claims court in my city and state seeking monetary damages for your violation of my rights. 

Sincerely, XXXX XXXX XXXX Please see the attached file.",None,"EQUIFAX, INC.",NY,11413,None,Consent provided,Web,03/18/24,Closed with non-monetary relief,Yes,N/A,8571288
