It took another six months for FCO to send their supportive documentation, a handwritten summary of the walk through done by their property manager after my departure. No court stipulations, nothing. 

I've asked XXXX for a summary of their investigation cc below : XX/XX/XXXX Re : confirmation # XXXX I received the results of the above investigation and its results that the information was deleted from my file. 

