Sincerely, XXXX XXXX XXXX Make sure to replace placeholders with your actual details and adjust any information to better reflect your specific situation.",None,"Block, Inc.",NY,10457,None,Consent provided,Web,09/02/24,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,9995091
