This statute explicitly states that XXXX, as the reporting entity, should not include transactions or experiences associated with the line of credit extended between the consumer and the reporting entity in my consumer report. 
I urge you to promptly update my utilization to 5 % or below within 10 calendar days or remove all utilization from the mentioned accounts. 

