08/27/24,Debt collection,Rental debt,Written notification about debt,Didn't receive enough information to verify debt,"Rent Recovery Solutions LLC XXXX  XXXX XXXX XXXX, XXXX XXXX XXXX, GA XXXX Re : Debt Validation Request Reference Number:XXXX  Attention Rent Recovery Solutions LLC : I am writing to you regarding a debt that you have claimed I owe. I do not acknowledge this debt and am requesting that you provide validation as required by the Fair Debt Collection Practices Act ( FDCPA ), 15 U.S.C. 1692g. 
Under the FDCPA, I have the right to request validation of the debt, and you are required to provide me with the following information : Proof that I owe the debt : Please provide the name and address of the original creditor, the amount of the debt, and an itemized statement showing how the debt was calculated. 
Verification of your authority to collect : Please provide documentation that you are legally authorized to collect this debt on behalf of the original creditor and a copy of the assignment contract that gives you authority to collect on this debt. 
Chain of custody : Please provide a complete chain of custody that shows the ownership and assignment of the debt from the original creditor to your company. 
Original agreement : Please provide a copy of the original agreement that I allegedly signed when this debt was incurred, which includes the terms and conditions. 
Your state license : Please provide proof of your license to collect debts in [ Your State ] and the date of issuance. 
The name and address of the original creditor. 
The date of the original debt and a detailed statement of the amount owed, including the principal, interest, fees, and any other charges. 
Copies of any contracts or agreements that I have signed, showing that I agreed to the debt. 
Proof that the debt is within the statute of limitations in my state. 
Evidence that you have the legal right to collect this debt, such as a copy of the assignment or purchase agreement. 
According to the FDCPA, 15 U.S.C. 1692g ( b ), while you are validating this debt, you must cease all collection activities, including reporting this debt to credit reporting agencies, until you have provided the requested validation. Furthermore, if you continue to pursue this debt without validating it, you will be in violation of federal law, and I will report your actions to the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau ( CFPB ) and my state 's Attorney General 's office. 
Please be advised that any attempt to contact me in any form ( phone, mail, etc. ) without validating this debt is a violation of the FDCPA and may result in legal action. 
I expect to receive your response within 30 days from the date of your receipt of this letter. Please send all correspondence to my address listed above. 
Thank you for your attention to this matter.",None,Rent Recovery Solutions,NY,11729,None,Consent provided,Web,08/27/24,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,9933562
