The FOLLOWING derogatory accounts allegations are either UNTRUE, UNVERFIED, INCORRECT, INCOMPLETE, UNTIMELY, NOT MINE, NOT MY RESPONSIBILITY, or otherwise NOT PROVEN COMPLIANT to regulatory federal reporting laws and or standards and MUST be removed immediately The infractions are as rollows : Alleging Creditor and Account as is reported as having a late payment my credit report : XXXX XXXX XXXX, XXXX XXXX and XXXX are reporting late payments in the past. 
I am demanding that this account be updated to Paid as Agreed and Never Late. 
