09/09/24,Checking or savings account,Checking account,Opening an account,Didn't receive terms that were advertised,"I received a targeted promotion from M & T Bank with a specific promo code, XXXX, via mail. The requirements were to open an account, access the online system, and maintain a balance of {$1000.00} for both XXXX and XXXX ( see attached mail for details ). By XX/XX/XXXX, I had successfully transferred {$1000.00} into the account and called the bank to confirm that my deposit would still qualify for the promotion. The customer service representative assured me that both the {$600.00} I had already deposited and the pending {$400.00}, which appeared on XX/XX/XXXX, would meet the requirements. 

Since XX/XX/XXXX was a Friday and XX/XX/XXXX and XXXX were a Saturday and Sunday, the {$400.00} didn't officially post until XX/XX/XXXX. Concerned about the delay, I called again to verify whether my deposits still met the requirements. Once again, the representative confirmed that everything was fine, even after I mentioned I would close the account if this wasn't the case. As a result, I maintained the required balance. 

However, when XX/XX/XXXX camethe date by which I was supposed to receive the {$250.00} bonusI did not receive it. Upon calling the bank, they refused to honor the bonus, despite XXXX separate employees confirming that I had qualified for it.",Company has responded to the consumer and the CFPB and chooses not to provide a public response,M&T BANK CORPORATION,NY,XXXXX,None,Consent provided,Web,09/09/24,Closed with monetary relief,Yes,N/A,10054205
