04/25/24,"Payday loan, title loan, personal loan, or advance loan",Personal line of credit,Incorrect information on your report,Account status incorrect,"The late payments in question violate the provisions outlined in the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ), specifically 15 U.S. Code 1681a and 15 U.S. Code 1681b, which mandate accurate reporting of credit information and disclosure of permissible purposes for accessing credit reports. Additionally, the creditor 's actions may be in violation of 15 U.S. Code 1666b, which prohibits creditors from treating credit card payments as late under certain circumstances. 

Despite my attempts to rectify the situation directly with the creditor, the late payments remain on my credit report, causing undue financial harm and impeding my ability to access credit on fair terms. I am reporting this because I want to ensure compliance with federal regulations governing credit reporting and lending practices. 

XXXX. XXXX - XXXX",Company has responded to the consumer and the CFPB and chooses not to provide a public response,"Prosper Marketplace, Inc.",NY,10952,None,Consent provided,Web,04/25/24,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,8858842
