07/30/24,Checking or savings account,Checking account,Managing an account,Problem accessing account,"On XX/XX/year>, I opened a checking account with Citibank. Since then, I have faced numerous issues, including : 1. Difficulties with fund transfers and subsequent overdrafts caused by Citibank 's mishandling of the situation. 
2. A block placed on my account due to unspecified security concerns on XX/XX/year>, without any clear explanation or timeline for resolution. 
XXXX. Inability to access my account and funds, causing severe financial hardship and inconvenience. 
XXXX. Inadequate customer support and communication, with representatives failing to provide effective assistance or timely resolution. 

I have made numerous attempts to resolve these issues through various channels, including contacting customer support, visiting a Citibank branch, and filing complaints with regulatory agencies ( CFPB, OCC, and XXXX XXXX XXXX  ). Despite these efforts, Citibank has failed to provide a satisfactory resolution. 

Citibank claims to have sent a verification letter containing a reference number, which I must provide along with information related to the opening of my account and subsequent activity. However, it has been well over the expected delivery time, and I have not received this letter. 

When I called Citibank to request another letter, their agents repeatedly hung up on me, further exacerbating the situation and demonstrating a lack of professionalism and concern for my issue. 

Citibank 's response to my previous complaint with the CFPB was inadequate, as it failed to address the core issues and the lack of communication on their part. They have not provided any clear explanation for the block on my account or offered any alternative means of identity verification, such as accepting my phone number, which is tied to my account. 

The prolonged lack of access to my funds has caused significant financial strain and personal distress, as I have bills and obligations that can not be met due to this issue.",Company has responded to the consumer and the CFPB and chooses not to provide a public response,"CITIBANK, N.A.",NY,10701,None,Consent provided,Web,07/30/24,Closed with non-monetary relief,Yes,N/A,9642258
