04/15/24,Debt collection,I do not know,Attempts to collect debt not owed,Debt was result of identity theft,"I received a phone call from someone claiming to be a representative of XXXX XXXX XXXX, I told them I was in the middle of something and didnt have long to talk, then I was asked to confirm my address, SSN and email ( which was not correct ) and I did not because I didnt feel comfortable giving my information was told my account is over-drafted I then asked how much was the claimed overdraft and was told they cant tell me unless I confirmed my information.

