03/12/24,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Improper use of your report,Reporting company used your report improperly,"In accordance with the Fair Credit Reporting act. The List of accounts below has violated my federally protected consumer rights. 

XXXX BANK XX/XX/2024 15 U.S. Code 1681e - Compliance procedures Whenever a consumer reporting agency prepares a consumer report it shall follow reasonable procedures to assure maximum possible accuracy of the information concerning the individual about whom the report relates I am writing to bring to your attention a discrepancy I identified upon reviewing my consumer report, specifically pertaining to XXXX instances of reported late payments on an account where I have consistently maintained a timely payment history. 

Recognizing the pivotal role that consumer reporting agencies play in maintaining the integrity of individuals ' credit histories, I hold a high regard the responsibility to ensure accurate and precise reporting. It is imperative that consumer information is reported with the utmost accuracy to preserve the integrity of credit profiles. 
upon thorough examination, I have ascertained that the reported late payments are inaccurate, as I have consistently upheld the terms of my financial agreements by remitting payments in a timely manner. Consequently, I kindly request the expeditious correction of these inaccuracies, with the appropriate adjustment to reflect the accurate status of "" paid as agreed on time ''. If not please provide proof with statements that these payments have not been paid on time. If proof can not be provided I demand these payments be updated to paid as agreed. 

To Facilitate this process, I have attached a screenshot. I appreciate your prompt attention to this matter and trust that the necessary steps will be taken to rectify the inaccuracies promptly. 

Also please investigate the inaccuracies that has been reported differently between the credit bureaus XXXX, Equifax XXXX XXXX should all have similar and accurate information. Thank You",None,"EQUIFAX, INC.",NY,10562,None,Consent provided,Web,03/12/24,Closed with non-monetary relief,Yes,N/A,8534237
