from that month to this present month XX/XX/XXXX, I paid {$7100.00}, XXXX XXXX dollars from my monthly payments went to the the interest, with only {$2100.00} going towards my outstanding balance of {$21000.00} which is now stands at {$19000.00}. This is where i am having a problem, why I am paying so much interest, I spoke to a Best Egg representative concerning this problem, she told that is how it is, I then ask to speak to a Supervisor, who then told me there is nothing she can do also, she then ask me if i want to enter a hardship program, i told her no, my problem is with the outrageous interest, she then said that is all she can offer me. I am seriously requesting the attorney general assistance with this problem, these charges by best egg and the XXXX XXXX XXXXXXXX XXXX  are absurd and myself as a consumer, should not be going through this. 
