04/20/24,Checking or savings account,Savings account,Managing an account,Problem accessing account,"- XX/XX/2024 : After trying to log onto my Marcus by Goldman Sachs account, I find out that the account has been temporarily locked. I call customer service to unlock the account. I am told that they can not "" authenticate '' my account because my phone number is not linked to my last name. Customer service representative says they would close my account and hangs up on me. I call again and this customer service representative tells me they would open a case and someone will call me within XXXX business days. 
- XX/XX/2024 : No one has called me, so I call them again. I am told that the case is still open and that there was nothing they could do. So I ask them to close the account because then the money would automatically be transferred to my checkings account on file. 
- XX/XX/2024 : I have not received a closure letter and the funds have not been transferred to my checkings account, so I call again. I am told that the previous customer service representative misinformed me about being able to close the account and that the case was still open. I am told that someone would call me. 
- XX/XX/2024 : I call again given that no one has reached out to me. I insist on speaking to someone who can offer me an alternative solution but am told that that is not possible because the customer service representative on the line can not "" authenticate '' me. I am told that my case is still under review. 
- XX/XX/2024 : I call again and, once again, I am told that the case is under review and that someone would call me. I am asking to speak to someone who can offer me an alternative solution and has more details but my request is denied. 

I have been locked out of my account and unable to access my funds for a month now. I have provided the company different ways of verification, including name, date of birth, social security number, address, and secret password set up when I opened the account. I am told that the "" authentication '' is unsuccessful because my phone number is linked to a different last name. This statement is incorrect as I have confirmed with my mobile provider that my phone number was correctly linked to my last name. 

