03/12/24,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Problem with a company's investigation into an existing problem,Investigation took more than 30 days,"I have asked TransUnion many times THE METHOD THEY USE TO "" VERIFY '' INFOMATION ON MY CREDIT REPORT IN DETAIL. XXXX, you fail to address that issue whatsoever, several time. You failed to answer me within 30 days which is illegal and by law you must remove the following information. 

NOT MY DEBT REMOVE IT : XXXX XXXX XXXX... 
XXXX XXXX XXXX .... 
XXXXXXXX XXXX THIS WAS ALREADY PAID AS A CHARGE OFF WITH a 1099c I filed with my taxes. YOU CAN NOT COLLECT ON A DEBT TWICE!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!

AND DO THE FOLLOWING BELOW : I dispute your claim and I am requesting validation from your pursuant to the Fair Debt Collection Practices Act, 15 USC 1692g Sec. 809 ( 8 ) ( FDCPA ).

- Provide a breakdown of fees including how you calculated what you claim I owe.

- Provide a copy of my signature on a contract or document that holds me responsible for his alleged debt.

-Cease any credit bureau reporting until debt had been validate by me as required under the FCRA .

- Send me proof that you are licensed to collect debt in my state. Send this information to my address listed enclosed and accept this letter send as my formal debt validation request, which I am allowed under the FDCPA.",Company has responded to the consumer and the CFPB and chooses not to provide a public response,"TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.",NY,12208,None,Consent provided,Web,03/12/24,Closed with non-monetary relief,Yes,N/A,8532676
