05/06/24,Credit card,General-purpose credit card or charge card,Trouble using your card,Can't use card to make purchases,"On XX/XX/year>, my attempt to make a purchase through Citi XXXX using my Citi credit card was declined. Upon contacting customer service, I was informed of a system error. The representative attempted to verify my phone number but was unsuccessful, resulting in an unresolved issue after a XXXX conversation. 

The following day, I contacted Citi again seeking a resolution. The customer service team repeated the verification issues and proposed sending a verification letter to my address, estimated to take XXXX business days. I requested a quicker resolution, such as supervisor intervention, but was told no supervisors were available, and the letter was the only option. 

By XX/XX/year>, the verification letter had not arrived. When I called to request alternative verification methods, I was told to wait another week as no other options were available. 

As of XX/XX/year>, I still have not received the verification letter. Further inquiries have resulted in the same response, with no provision to update or confirm my mailing address, despite my ongoing attempts. 

This series of interactions has not only prevented me from utilizing my Citi credit card but also calls into question the value of the annual fee I pay. I am seeking an immediate resolution to access my account, a waiver of the annual fee for this year, and compensation for the inconvenience and inability to use my card benefits during this period.",Company has responded to the consumer and the CFPB and chooses not to provide a public response,"CITIBANK, N.A.",NY,111XX,None,Consent provided,Web,05/06/24,Closed with non-monetary relief,Yes,N/A,8942554
