This is my several request to you to correct this in writing. The several attempts by phone were never successful either, as you out source to XXXX and they promise corrections that never happen. I tried numerous times to get my statements from you, but never received them. 

My previous letter listed the sections of the FCRA that you are violating. You are in clear violation as I was not late and I never received notification that negative data was going to be furnished to the bureaus about me. I also noted that I was sending a copy of the letter certified mail-return receipt to the proper agencies. I will do the same with this letter. I will then lodge formal complaints and pursue legal action if you do not supply proof of my late payment of confirmation that it has been removed. XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX",Company has responded to the consumer and the CFPB and chooses not to provide a public response,"TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.",NY,11205,None,Consent provided,Web,08/13/24,Closed with non-monetary relief,Yes,N/A,9780150
