07/20/24,Checking or savings account,Checking account,Managing an account,Problem using a debit or ATM card,"On XX/XX/XXXX, an unauthorized withdrawal was made from my TD Bank checking account of {$900.00}. On the same day I went to a TD Bank branch to ask about what this transaction was about and how it was made without my knowledge. The manager of the TD Bank told me that someone with my Driver License ID was able to withdraw the money even though they didn't have my bank card. I proceeded to freeze all of my accounts and lock my cards. 
Soon after on the evening of XX/XX/XXXX, I received another call from TD Bank that said the perpetrator that had stolen my identity attempted to withdraw more money from my Checking account from a different branch. Seeing as how my account was already flagged for potential fraud they withheld the ID that the perpetrator used. They told me that the person somehow had a real copy of Driver License card. It seems that my identity was compromised, but I was shocked at how relaxed the verification process at TD Bank was.",None,TD BANK US HOLDING COMPANY,NY,10305,None,Consent provided,Web,07/20/24,Closed with monetary relief,Yes,N/A,9558376
