06/28/24,Credit card,General-purpose credit card or charge card,"Other features, terms, or problems",Other problem,On XX/XX/year> I had a charge on my XXXX card for {$2300.00} from XXXX XXXX XXXX. When I stayed in the hotel with my husband he had an accident due to negligence by the hotel. The hotel has an unusual amount of condensation and because of wet floors and stairs my husband fell down the stairs and sprained his ankle on the second day we were there. I asked the hotel for the video and they refused to release it. The hotel did nothing to aid my husband and for the rest of our vacation he was unable to walk around freely and we had to cancel all of our activities. I disputed the charge with chase XXXX and got a very abusive response. They had terrible service telling me from the start they dont think they can help. chase makes it difficult to talk to management and by having only a telephone number makes it impossible to talk to anyone. When I called I had to spend hours waiting to talk. Chase doesnt offer email communication or chats. When I never heard from them I called again a few months later to find the results and they informed me on the phone it was denied. Chase never send me a written response until I asked for it. I disputed again and now we needed to go into arbitration but chase never asked me for my side or any new information. I was not involved in the arbitration which I find unacceptable. Chase said they represented me in the arbitration but when I asked for the legal notes with names of the lawyers and arbitrator they never send me that information. Chase is my CC company and they never were on my side. Chase didnt do their fiduciary responsibilities to protect ME the consumer. All I see is XXXX huge corporations getting together to squash a consumer rights.,None,JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.,NY,11581,None,Consent provided,Web,06/28/24,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,9374534
