07/13/23,"Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports",Credit reporting,Problem with a credit reporting company's investigation into an existing problem,Problem with personal statement of dispute,"XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX, New York XXXX Date of Birth : XX/XX/XXXX SS # : XXXX Dear Sir/Madam, I am writing to dispute the following items on my credit report : XXXX XXXX XXXX Late Payment Account XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX Late Payment Account XXXX XXXX XXXX Late Payment Account XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX Charge Off Account XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX Charge Off Account XXXX XXXX XXXXXX/XX/XXXX Inquiry XXXX XXXX XXXX  XX/XX/XXXX Inquiry XXXX XX/XX/XXXX Inquiry XXXX XXXX XXXX XX/XX/XXXX Inquiry I believe that these items are inaccurate and do not reflect my true credit history. As per the Fair Credit Reporting Act, all information reported on my credit report must be accurate and verifiable. However, the items listed above are either outdated, incorrect or do not belong to me. 



Regarding the late payment accounts, I would like to inform you that I have been a responsible borrower and have always paid my bills on time. Any late payments made were due to unforeseen circumstances and were not a result of my negligence or inability to pay. 



As for the charged off accounts, I dispute their validity as I have no record of any outstanding debt with these institutions. I request that you provide me with detailed information on these accounts, including the name of the creditor, the account number, and the amount owed. 



Furthermore, I request that you investigate the inquiries made by XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX. I do not have any business dealings with these institutions and I am concerned that my personal information may have been compromised. 



I kindly request that you remove these items from my credit report or provide me with evidence that proves their validity. I look forward to hearing back from you soon. 



Sincerely, XXXX XXXX",None,"EQUIFAX, INC.",NY,115XX,None,Consent provided,Web,07/13/23,Closed with non-monetary relief,Yes,N/A,7249568
