04/24/24,Debt or credit management,Mortgage modification or foreclosure avoidance,Charged upfront or unexpected fees,None,"I did a short sale in XX/XX/XXXX, where the same law firm represented the buyer and the seller, which I was not aware of until after the transaction was completed. I moved out of my home prior to the closing date in XX/XX/XXXX. New buyers moved into the property after the closing date ( XX/XX/XXXX ). Later on I found out from the XXXX XXXX XXXX that the short sale was never recorded and the attorneys at the law firm stole the money, the down payment from XXXX XXXX ( buyer ) paid to XXXX XXXX 's law office. The deed was never recorded and the property remained in my name and my underlying mortgage was not paid. 

Confessions of judgment in which both XXXX and XXXX acknowledged receipt of mortgage loan funds ( {$310000.00} ) from XXXX  XXXX XXXX on behalf of XXXX XXXX for the purchase of the property. Both attorneys were indicted. On XX/XX/XXXX, XXXX XXXX, plead guilty to XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX in the first degree and grand larceny in the second degree, she admitted to the fraud and misappropriation of funds. On XX/XX/XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX, XXXX pled guilty to Criminal facilitation in the fourth degree, he admitted to being responsible for facilitating the fraud and misappropriation of the funds committed by XXXX XXXX. 

New owners took possession of the property ( XXXX family house ) and after finding out that the property was not transferred to them, they continued to live in the house ( for free ) not paying the mortgage or rent to me while collecting rent from the 2nd floor and basement apartment. They lived on the property from XX/XX/XXXX ( after closing date ) until XX/XX/XXXX which was when I was finally able to evict them. My bank PHH Mortgage started a foreclosure proceeding against me in XX/XX/XXXX and knowing all the facts that I had not possession or occupancy of the property and the Persaud took possession of the property and occupied the property they are now refusing to do a loan modification. I am begging for your help in trying to get this matter resolved once and for all. I am a XXXX  mother with XXXX girls and my home was robbed from me and now that I finally got possession of my home again the bank is refusing to do a modification on the loan and it trying to foreclose.",None,Onity Group Inc.,NY,114XX,None,Consent provided,Web,04/24/24,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,8852546
