03/07/24,Checking or savings account,Checking account,Managing an account,Deposits and withdrawals,"We have XXXX business bank accounts with TD Bank. TD Bank Account # XXXX and TD Bank Account # XXXX for XXXX XXXX XXXX, XXXX and TD Bank Account # XXXX for XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX. I have personally visited the bank on XXXX occasions, called them on recorded lines at least XXXX XXXX and sent XXXX emails including a written official letter. We were told someone name "" XXXX '' in their XXXX XXXX Department is investigating our accounts which were frozen on XX/XX/2024. Subsequently, I visited the bank and called on numerous occasions which I was informed XXXX wires were in question and given dates. I called both clients ( with wires in question ) they were both happy with our company, so I drafted a letter on XX/XX/2024, with the clients ' names, phone numbers and exact wires and emailed XXXX XXXX. Since then, I have received no written or oral correspondence from anyone at TD Bank. So, on XX/XX/2024 I called XXXX XXXX who was very rude to me and literally almost challenge me to a face-to-face fight to come to her bank branch. So, I wrote a written complaint to her and yet no response. I followed up with another call on XX/XX/2024 on XXXX ( Fraud Dept ) I was promised it would be resolved by XX/XX/2024 and I would receive a call. I have not received XXXX written or verbal response.",None,TD BANK US HOLDING COMPANY,NY,11530,None,Consent provided,Web,03/07/24,Closed with non-monetary relief,Yes,N/A,8502143
