06/27/24,Credit card,General-purpose credit card or charge card,Getting a credit card,Application denied,"This is made to declare my concern regarding security fraud committed by the underwriting department of JP MORGAN CHASE BANK and the violation of my rights as a consumer under various federal laws. Additionally, I seek to address the denial of my right to credit, which is in direct contravention of these laws. 

XXXX. XXXX XXXX Transaction : ** - On XX/XX/year>, I engaged in a consumer credit transaction with JP MORGAN CHASE BANK by submitting a duly endorsed application for credit. 
- My endorsed application generated securities, from which I am being unjustly withheld from the benefits. 

XXXX. **Violation of Rights : ** - The underwriting department of CHASE BANK has denied my credit application without just cause, violating my rights under the Equal Credit Opportunity Act ( ECOA ), XXXX U.S.C XXXX XXXX et seq., which mandates that all consumers be given an equal opportunity to obtain credit. 
- Specifically, XXXX XXXX. XXXX and its implementing regulation, XXXX XXXX XXXX, prohibit creditors from discriminating against applicants on the basis of race, XXXX, religion, national origin, XXXX, marital status, age, or because all or part of an applicant 's income derives from any public assistance program. 
- Furthermore, the denial constitutes a breach of the Truth in Lending Act ( XXXX ), XXXX XXXX. XXXX et seq., which aims to promote the informed use of consumer credit by requiring disclosures about its terms and cost. 
- The actions of CHASE BANK also appear to contravene the Banking Act, which ensures the proper regulation and conduct of banking operations. 
- Additionally, the actions may violate the Bill of Exchange Act, which governs the rights and responsibilities associated with negotiable instruments. 

XXXX. **Allegation of Security Fraud : ** - I allege that CHASE BANK has engaged in security fraud by utilizing my endorsed application to generate securities without providing me with any benefit or return, thereby defrauding me and infringing upon my rights as a consumer.",None,JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.,NY,10456,None,Consent provided,Web,06/27/24,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,9363035
03/21/24,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Information belongs to someone else,"XXXX XXXX XX/XX/XXXX TO WHOM IT MAY CONCERN, THIS IS ABOUT THE INACCURACY THAT IS INEQUITABLY FURNISHED BY YOUR ORGANIZATION ON MY CONSUMER REPORT. DUE TO THIS INACCURACY, MY RIGHT TO EXTEND CREDIT HAS BEEN DAMAGED TO A GREAT EXTENT. AS A RESULT, I WAS DISCRIMINATED AGAINST AND REFUSED THE FOLLOWING : 1. CREDIT CARD FROM XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX ACCORDING TO 15 USC 1681 ( A ) ( 3 ), CONSUMER REPORTING AGENCIES HAVE ASSUMED A VITAL ROLE IN ASSEMBLING AND EVALUATING CONSUMER CREDIT AND OTHER INFORMATION ON CONSUMERS.

THERE IS NO SUCH LAW THAT STATES ANYTHING THAT NEEDS TO BE REPORTED TO A CONSUMER REPORTING AGENCY, THEREFORE YOUR ORGANIZATION IS LIABLE.

FURTHER, PURSUANT 15 USC 1681 ( A ) ( 4 ), A CONSUMER REPORTING AGENCY MUST EXERCISE THEIR GRAVE RESPONSIBILITIES WITH FAIRNESS, IMPARTIALITY AND A RESPECT FOR THE CONSUMERS RIGHT TO PRIVACY.

YOUR ORGANIZATION NEITHER EXERCISED ITS RESPONSIBILITIES WITH FAIRNESS AND IMPARTIALITY NOR PROTECTED MY RIGHT TO PRIVACY.

I AM DEMANDING, UNDER PENALTIES OF PERJURY, FOR YOU TO GIVE ME A PIECE OF EVIDENCE THAT THE INFORMATION WHICH IS BEING REPORTED HAS BEEN PROPERLY INVESTIGATED. ALSO, PROVIDE ME WITH THE DETAILS OF THE SYSTEM ADOPTED BY YOUR ORGANIZATION TO DETERMINE WHETHER THE TRANSACTION TOOK PLACE OR NOT PURSUANT TO 15 USC 1681 ( A ) ( B ) YOUR ORGANIZATION DID NOT ADOPT SUCH PROCEDURES THAT MEET THE NEED OF COMMERCE FOR CONSUMER CREDIT. AS A RESULT, I HEREBY DEMAND TO DO THE FOLL
OWING : 1. DELETION OF THE ACCOUNT XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX 2. DELETION OF THE ACCOUNT : XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX SINCERELY, XXXX XXXX",None,"EQUIFAX, INC.",NY,11422,None,Consent provided,Web,03/21/24,Closed with non-monetary relief,Yes,N/A,8593947
06/21/24,"Money transfer, virtual currency, or money service",Virtual currency,Money was not available when promised,None,"In XX/XX/XXXX, Coinbase has my account "" flagged for a manual review ''. I will be XXXX XXXX XXXX this year, and I am XXXX. I am guilty of not checking my email daily, and I missed the first XXXX emails they sent me on XX/XX/XXXX & XX/XX/XXXX, telling me my account was under review. I was not interested in trading or cashing in any of my crypto, and did not realize they had frozen my account until XX/XX/XXXX when I wanted to cash in some of my bitcoin. On XX/XX/XXXX I responded to their original email, and supplied my past employment records, my bank statement, my overall net worth, and how I use my Coinbase funds to repays my children 's student loans. Between XX/XX/XXXX, and XX/XX/XXXX, I had XXXX interactions with the Coinbase compliance XXXX. Since then I have had several other correspondences with them, Including Coinbase demanding Hundreds of pages of documents, such as : 2 years of tax returns ( uploaded in PDF form ), other bank statements with my spending explanations, official business records dating back over 10 years, my other XXXX accounts, bank records of my Social Security and pension deposits, etc. I put in a complaint to the Coinbase Complaint Dept & after waiting XXXX business days, they claimed I had not responded to an email in XXXX, and so they considered my case closed. Not only did I respond promptly to their XXXX Email, they quoted my response in another XX/XX/XXXX, request for more information. Coinbase has now kept my assets from me for over 8 months, even though I have explained the financial hardship they have continuously caused me. PLEASE HELP.",None,"Coinbase, Inc.",NY,11561,Older American,Consent provided,Web,06/21/24,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,9321218
06/20/24,Debt collection,Credit card debt,False statements or representation,"Impersonated attorney, law enforcement, or government official","I would like to advise you of a debt collection scam being run by the "" XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX, XXXX, XXXX, XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX. '' I will hereafter refer to them as MJRF I received a "" Summons and Complaint '' in the mail and it looked like I was being sued. I am attaching a copy. 

I also received communications from the debt collector asking me to call up a "" non-attorney debt collector. '' Naturally, I tried to file an answer to my complaint with the XXXX XXXX XXXX, where I was being sued. Imagine my surprise to find out, despite all indications to the contrary, that I was not actually being sued. 

Let me explain. Lawyers must file multiple forms to initiate a suit. One of these is an "" XXXX '' or "" Request for Judicial Intervention '' which then causes the case to go to court. 

XXXX filed the forms necessary to create an index number, which makes it look on the county website as if I am being sued, however, the suit has no judge assigned because they didn't file all the necessary paperwork. They just filed enough paperwork to invoke fear. 

So they have given the impression that they are suing me, but they are not. The kicker is if I want to file a counterclaim or have their suit dismissed, I would have to pay to do so. The amount is quite a lot of money, and quite time-consuming. 

My guess is this is done on purpose. They give the alleged debtor the fear of being sued, but are not open to any downside. Because in a suit, I can claim FDCPA violations and damages on my side. 

I would wonder if I had not filed an answer they would possibly have filed an RJI to force a default judgment. 

This is shameful behavior, and what's worse is they keep trying to get me to talk to non-attorneys. The numbers listed on their correspondence do not work or funnel me to voicemail, and I had to go through some hoops to get a person. 

I'd ask the CFPB to come down hard on them. This is not acceptable behavior. I have disputed the debt, and have the right not to be lied to, or referred to a "" non-attorney debt collector '' representing the fact that they are part of some kind of legal proceeding.",None,Mullooly Jeffrey Rooney & Flynn,NY,125XX,None,Consent provided,Web,06/20/24,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,9306749
