I deposited {$1000.00} on XX/XX/XXXX. Six days later, on XX/XX/XXXX, it became available. 

I spent HOURS on the phone/chatting with Marcus, trying to transfer approximately {$450.00} to pay for my airplane ticket to my Uncle 's funeral on XX/XX/XXXX. My experience was devastating, but the agents gaslighted me, insisting there was nothing they could do! 

I deposited {$1000.00} on XX/XX/XXXX, but the funds were not available until XX/XX/XXXX, six days later. I confronted the company about their illegal procedures on the chat, and the manager said I had to call in to resolve the matter. They were closed. 

Finally, in my previous complaint to the CFPB, Marcus by Goldman SAID THE AGREEMENT IS FIVE DAYS! 

