03/22/24,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Problem with a company's investigation into an existing problem,Their investigation did not fix an error on your report,"If you persist in apparent disregard, noncompliance, or deficiency of substantial, satisfying, and/or otherwise evident proof of compliant reporting practices, I must warn you that this letter serves as my official notice prior to my likely decision to petition a civil court nearest me for a writ of review related to the aforementioned issues I suspect. Please be advised that I am the injured consumer of your unproven or inadequate reporting practices. As such, I am contesting the assumed, but actually very conditional, reporting privileges for any and all of your claims challenged within this consumer complaint. This declaration calls for your demonstration of authoritative, certifiable, compliant, lawful reporting that assuredly adheres to no less than the mandatory state and federal reporting mandates and statutes. My demand for your fastidious scrutiny shall categorically include, but not be limited to, your adherence to accords cited within the FCBA, FCRA, ECOA, as well as any and all applicable laws within my state, proven to be commodiously ample for illustrating your adequate statutory reporting occurred exactly as related to any claim purported by you in my report ( s ). Particularly concerning to me is if any or all of your claim 's aspects are alleged yet display potential deficiency, having plausible deviations from your obligatory utilized industry standards for legal, fair, and ethical reporting and did so with respect to a comme il faut status. Incontestably, your compulsion should be that of certifiable conformity to the Metro 2 Data-filled Field Formatted Reporting Standards, per CDIA!

NOTICE FOR REMOVAL OF INQUIRY REQUEST : According to Section 604 of US CODE 15 USC 1681 et seq., it is clearly stated that any entity requesting access to a consumer 's credit report must have a lawfully acquired and permissible purpose as outlined by the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ). We demand to know if you and/or any other reporting party have provable and demonstrated lawful permissible purpose ( s ) for obtaining my credit report profile or any portion thereof. You must provide physically verifiable proof of this lawful permissible purpose, even if I have not authorized the inquiry or have no knowledge of it. Failure to provide such proof means that you must remove any inquiry reporting related to the event ( s ) in question. I am challenging you to demonstrate your mandatorily submitted permissible purpose proofs, and I hereby demand that you delete any such alleged inquiry reporting upon your failure to do so in a timely manner, whether willfully or due to your reckless ignorance. 

Listed below are the Accounts that are being challenged XXXX XXXXXXXX XXXX  XXXX Listed below are the Inquiries that are being challenged XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXXXX/XX/XXXX",None,"EQUIFAX, INC.",NY,11367,None,Consent provided,Web,03/22/24,Closed with non-monetary relief,Yes,N/A,8593420
