I am formally requesting a thorough investigation into these reported late payments. I kindly ask that you provide concrete evidence, such as statements, indicating the alleged late payments. If sufficient proof can not be provided to substantiate these claims, I insist that these payments be promptly updated to reflect their accurate status as "" Paid on time ''. 

Also there have been inaccurate and inconsistencies being reported from XXXX XXXX XXXX, that reflect different results on my consumer report. Please investigate. 

