d XXXX continue to violate my consumer rights, I will accelerate legal actions pursuant 15 US Code 1681n - Civil liability for willful noncompliance -Please See Attached",None,LEXISNEXIS,NY,11217,None,Consent provided,Web,04/29/24,Closed with explanation,No,N/A,8885121
