03/11/24,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Problem with a company's investigation into an existing problem,Their investigation did not fix an error on your report,"I am reminding you once again that you must remove any claims listed above or below that have not met the minimum criteria required for you to assume the privilege of reporting. If you fail to prove the undeniable facts of each allegation and adhere to the necessary reporting practices mandated by the CDIA 's Metro 2 Compliance standards, then I contest the reportability of any such claim. The CDIA 's CRRG stipulates that "" ANY DEVIATION FROM THESE STANDARDS JEOPARDIZES THE INTEGRITY OF THE DATA. '' Therefore, it is imperative that you accept my challenge to prove the accuracy and compliance of each claim. I demand that you remove any such claim immediately from reporting as I have requested. 

I want to make it clear that you have no right to act in dereliction, as you hold me under threat of financial and/or creditworthiness injury ( ies ). I demand that if you are unwilling or unable to comply with my request, as demanded, and as otherwise mandatory to retain or regain compliance of reporting no later than 20 days from your receipt of this lawful notice of consumer complaint, you immediately and forevermore thereafter cease any and all derogatory and/or injurious actions against me, including but not limited to the foul actions to report and/or collec

t unverified, untrue, invalid, or elsewise not certifiably compliant claim ( s ) and/or debt ( s ). Below listed is the currently reported not yet proven valid nor demonstrated as being certifiably compliant reported allegation
( s ) of information that I mark as being in question. 

