05/07/24,Checking or savings account,Checking account,Managing an account,Banking errors,"On XX/XX/year>, I filed a complaint with this Institution about Key Bank. The complaint id is XXXX. 
I am filing a new complaint as i have yet to hear anything from Key Bank nor received my missing funds. I have made several attempts to call Key Bank to check the status of my issues with them. All i have gotten out of the calls are a bunch of hang ups, being switch from one department to another with the call ALWAYS being "" dropped ''. 
As I have mentioned before, this issue with Key Bank has been going on for well over a year now and I feel that this issue is being taken for a game or a joke by Key Bank and yet my hardship, XXXX XXXX and stress is at an all time high. 
As i mentioned, I have previously reached out to this organization for help. You are supposed to be for the consumer according to your name. Or is it like most other organizations that are suppose to be for the consumer, customer or working man, that says they are for the people but in reality are for the corporation 's big and small and wonder why people are going through so much XXXX. 
Is there somewhere above you that i should be trying to get help from? Thus far I'm not seeing where help comes from for this institution. From the start Key bank was given 60 days to resolve the issue by this organization. Key Bank responded by saying they sent everything to yet another department and you closed the case. 
How is that helpful or beneficial to me in getting by money returned? 
What exactly is it that this company does? From my research it was understood that this institution protects consumers from banks and leaders when they are being taken advantage of or being mistreated in any way financially. It appears to me and my situation that that is not he case. Instead, it's an institution that always the average man to be mercilessly taken advantage of by the big banks. At what point does the Consumer Finacial Protection Bureau actually protect? Is it the financial protection for consumers as your name suggest, or just the opposite in protecting big banking? 
Every other banking avenue i have taken has led me to this organization as the institution that will handle things and gat things done. 
I am sure that if anyone at CFPB or Key Bank was going through what i have been for well over a year would feel and see things as i do. 
The money they owe me is major to me but yet only pennies to them. 
So again i come to where I have been directed in getting this matter handled and rectified and hopefully with great haste. 
Perhaps this is something i should take to an investigating news station. I'm sure this story would be something they would love to cover and uncover even more. I'm sure I am not the only person going through this with either entity.",None,KEYCORP,NY,143XX,None,Consent provided,Web,05/07/24,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,8938060
