I have not received the bonus and called the wells fargo customer service on XX/XX/XXXX. The agent I spoke to kept asking me for details about the promotional bonus, and claimed not to be able to locate the offer on her end. Additionally, they claimed that the customer is responsible for proving that they had a promotional bonus on offer at account opening. They refused to provide any further details related to my account or the promotional bonus. 

