ter I had found out the action that BOA had taken, they stated that because my card was always in my position and was not stolen, it's either I used it or gave someone the card to be used ; because the chip can not be duplicated. 

This statement/investigation from the BOA is unequivalently not true and totally incorrect. I am asking for your help in this matter and or your advice on how I can further get this matter resolved, and to have BOA replenish my funds back in my account. BOA is engaged in unfair practices and not abiding by FDIC agreement/policy. 


