03/19/24,Checking or savings account,Checking account,Problem with a lender or other company charging your account,Transaction was not authorized,"Somebody hacked into My Credit Karma Account.

Credit I'm Really at a loss of words, I've been banking with Credit Karma for years and I really trusted them. I can not afford to take a {$450.00} loss because they failed to protect my account from hackers. My card was locked because i was not using it, but someone hacked my account and got in through the virtural account on my card and took out all of my money.I just got back my tax return and i was able to transfer {$700.00} to my external account. I left {$400.00} in my account. I had about {$48.00} saved up in Credit Karma Save and {$400.00} in my Spend accounts. Last week, I got a call from some random number, with an automated voice claiming to be Credit Karma and saying there's fraud activity going on with my account and they wanted me to verify a sequence of numbers in a text they sent me over the phone. I immediately thought this was some type of scammer trying to get my information and hung up. ( I did not provide any information ) These are the transactions that i did not authorize : Looking for disputed transactions? See disputes XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX",None,Credit Karma,NY,11236,None,Consent provided,Web,03/19/24,Closed with monetary relief,Yes,N/A,8576760
