03/21/24,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Information belongs to someone else,"XXXX XXXX Experian and XXXX have violated my consumer rights, and I have provided proof multiple times. But unfortunately, these companies believe themselves to be higher than the law itself. 

Who is going to govern these agencies? 

By the Fair Credit Reporting Act. The List of accounts below has violated my federally protected consumer rights to privacy and confidentiality under 15 USC 1681. 

