04/11/24,Credit card,General-purpose credit card or charge card,Problem with a purchase shown on your statement,Credit card company isn't resolving a dispute about a purchase on your statement,"XX/XX/XXXX : As of today, Coinbase Card has fraudulently withheld a credit to my account in the amount of {$520.00} for over XXXX years. Despite repeated requests to Coinbase XXXX, the status still shows "" Refund Pending ''. 

XX/XX/XXXX : I made a purchase with XXXX on my Coinbase Card in the amount of {$1500.00}. 

XX/XX/XXXX : XXXX refunded {$520.00} to the same Coinbase Card after receiving my device trade-in. Coinbase Card attached a "" Refund Pending '' status to this amount. 

XX/XX/XXXX : I emailed the following correspondence to Coinbase Support ( help @ coinbase.com ) : "" Hello - This refund of {$520.00} from XXXX has been pending in my Coinbase account for nearly XXXX month. It has not been added to my USD wallet. 

XXXX released the refund on their end on XX/XX/XXXX. I just spoke with XXXX of your managers at Coinbase who told me that he shows that the refund finished processing on your end on XX/XX/XXXX. He gave me Coinbase XXXX # XXXX. Also, XXXX provided an Invoice # XXXX for the refund amount of {$520.00}. Please use the information provided above to track down the transaction issue and release the funds asap. 

Respectfully, I have only received canned email responses from Coinbase regarding this issue... Please reach out with any questions. '' XX/XX/XXXX : Received the following autoresponse from Coinbase Support : "" Thanks for contacting Coinbase Support about Coinbase Card. 

After a merchant refunds your transaction, we'll add the refunded amount to your USD wallet in your Coinbase account. It can take up to 10 days for a merchant to process a refund, however, please be assured that once Coinbase receives your refund, it will be posted to your Coinbase Card account immediately. 

Please note that you'll lose any rewards you earned on this transaction. 

For more information, see our help article XX/XX/XXXXcoinbaseXX/XX/XXXXcoinbaseXX/XX/XXXXcoinbaseXX/XX/XXXXcoinbaseXX/XX/XXXXXX/XX/XXXX '' XX/XX/XXXX : Received the following email from Coinbase Support : "" Thanks for contacting Coinbase Support.

Were working with a specialist to review the information youve provided. We will follow up with you as soon as we have an update. Thank you for your patience. '' XX/XX/XXXX : I emailed the following correspondence to Coinbase Support after no follow-up was received : "" Hi - It has been over a month since I have not had rightful access to my funds. Any update on this issue? If not, please provide an estimate on when I should expect a resolution. '' As of today, Coinbase Card has fraudulently withheld a credit to my account in the amount of {$520.00} for over XXXX years. I have received no communication from Coinbase responsive to this issue since XX/XX/XXXX.",None,"Coinbase, Inc.",NY,10705,None,Consent provided,Web,04/11/24,Closed with monetary relief,Yes,N/A,8752622
