( 2 ) Designation of loans Loans made to borrowers under this part that, except as otherwise specified in this part, have the same terms, conditions, and benefits as loans made to borrowers under ( A ) section 1078 of this title shall be known as Federal Direct XXXX Loans ; ( B ) section 10782 of this title shall be known as Federal Direct PLUS Loans ; ( C ) section 10783 of this title shall be known as Federal Direct Consolidation Loans ; and ( D ) section 10788 of this title shall be known as Federal Direct Unsubsidized XXXX Loans. 
( XXXX ) Termination of authority to make interest subsidized loans to graduate and professional students ( A ) In general Subject to subparagraph ( B ) and notwithstanding any provision of this part or part B, for any period of instruction beginning on or after XX/XX/XXXX ( i ) a graduate or professional student shall not be eligible to receive a Federal Direct XXXX loan under this part ; and ( ii ) the maximum annual amount of Federal Direct Unsubsidized XXXX loans such a student may borrow in any academic year ( as defined in section 1088 ( a ) ( 2 ) of this title ) or its equivalent shall be the maximum annual amount for such student determined under section 10788 of this title, plus an amount equal to the amount of Federal Direct XXXX loans the student would have received in the absence of this subparagraph. 
