05/16/24,Checking or savings account,Checking account,Managing an account,Fee problem,"On XX/XX/24 I received an e-mail from Citibank that my current bank account was transitioning to an enhanced account, implying that it was better for me ; in fact, the terms are more onerous and I was notified that the change was going to happen automatically. I asked for a comparison of my current terms versus the new ones, but was notified that they didn't have that information available. This e-mail was purposely misleading and pretended as if this was beneficial to a customer, when this is far from true.",Company has responded to the consumer and the CFPB and chooses not to provide a public response,"CITIBANK, N.A.",NY,10024,Older American,Consent provided,Web,05/16/24,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,9029444
