04/11/24,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Problem with a company's investigation into an existing problem,Their investigation did not fix an error on your report,"I am an Identity theft victim and Transunion refused to block the accounts on report despite providing them with all of my information thats requested for a block. I provided them all of the documents required for a block of the information. I sent my ID, my Identity theft report, my social security card as well as a utility bill. They stated that they verified the accounts but The fraudulent accounts are also 100 % inaccurate and are in violation of usc1681e ( b ). I attached all of the documents that I sent Transunion via certified mail along with a notarized letter. All of the accounts agreements with the creditors are under litigation. If they actually did an investigation, they would know that from the creditors. That's how I know it's a computer that rejected my Identity theft claim.",Company has responded to the consumer and the CFPB and chooses not to provide a public response,"TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.",NY,117XX,None,Consent provided,Web,04/11/24,Closed with non-monetary relief,Yes,N/A,8743062
