04/08/24,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Information belongs to someone else,"Trans Union XXXX and XXXX have violated my consumer rights, and I have provided proof multiple times. But unfortunately, these companies believe themselves to be higher than the law itself. 

Who is going to govern these agencies? 

By the Fair Credit Reporting Act. The List of accounts below has violated my federally protected consumer rights to privacy and confidentiality under 15 USC 1681. 

XXXX  - XXXX - Under XXXX XXXX XXXX - permissible purpose of consumer reports, THE LAW CLEARLY STATES : Subject to subsection ( c ) any consumer reporting agency may furnish a consumer report under the accordance with the written instructions of the consumer to whom it relates- THIS ACCOUNT IS INACCURATE, I DID NOT INCUR ANY LATE PAYMENTS. PLEASE UPDATE TO PAID ON TIME XXXX XXXX - XXXX - Under 15 USC 1681b - permissible purpose of consumer reports, THE LAW CLEARLY STATES : Subject to subsection ( c ) any consumer reporting agency may furnish a consumer report under the accordance with the written instructions of the consumer to whom it relates- THIS ACCOUNT IS INACCURATE, I DID NOT INCUR ANY LATE PAYMENTS. PLEASE UPDATE TO PAID ON TIME Incorrect Address - XXXXXXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXXXXXX, NY, XXXX - personal information is inaccurate please delete immediately. 

Incorrect Address - XXXX XXXX XXXX, XXXX XXXX, NY, XXXX - personal information is inaccurate please delete immediately. 

