CRA result of the failure, you have failed to maintain reasonable procedures designed to limit the furnishing of consumer reports to the purposes listed under 604 ( a ) ( 2 ) of the FCRA, you have failed to follow the requirements sent forth pursuant to 607 of the FCRA, Your actions willful noncompliance of the requirement imposed under the FCRA, holds you liable to i the consumer and you are required to be fined {$1000.00} pursuant to 616 of the FCRA result of the failure, XXXX XXXX - never gave you Transunion the written instructions to furnish a report on my behalf, You have no permissible purpose Pursuant to 604 ( a ) ( 2 ) of the FCRA to furnish any report on my behalf,. You have been negligent in failing to comply fails to comply with 604 ( a ) ( 2 ) under the FCRA, you are required to be fined {$1000.00} pursuant to 617 of the FCRA result of the failure Transunion You have obtained my information which is prohibited 604 ( f ) ( 1 ) ( 2 ), Transunion you have obtain a consumer report for a purpose that is not authorized to be furnished under a permissible purpose and you have no certified purpose pursuant to 607 of the FCRA as user of my report though any general of specific certification Transunion your actions willfully fails to comply with any requirement imposed under the FCRA, are required to be fined between XXXX pursuant to 15 U.S. Code 1681n ( a ) ( 1 ) ( A ) result of the failure Pursuant to 618 of FCRA i can take action to enforce liability for failure to follow the requirements created under the FCRA based on your actions which this lawsuit may be brought in any appropriate United States district court, without regard to the amount in controversy, or in any other court of competent jurisdiction, With Explicit Reservation of all Right, Without Prejudice UCC 1-308. 

