03/24/23,"Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports",Credit reporting,Problem with a credit reporting company's investigation into an existing problem,Their investigation did not fix an error on your report,"I am writing to file a formal complaint regarding the incorrect status on my account that has been reported by your institution to the credit bureaus. I have discovered that my credit report shows late payments on my account, which is inaccurate and unjustifiable. To make matters worse, each credit bureau shows a different delinquent status and wrong information. 

I have contacted your institution several times to address this issue, but to my dismay, I have not received any assistance or resolution to this problem. Despite my persistent efforts to seek clarification and have this issue rectified, I am still being disadvantaged by this error. 

I demand to be provided with all the proof of my investigation and the proof of the negative payment status for this account. If the negative information in this account can not be deleted, then it must be corrected immediately to reflect the true status of my account. 

As a responsible borrower, I have always made timely payments and have never missed any payments. Therefore, it is unfair to have my credit score and reputation tarnished by this incorrect information. The incorrect reporting has caused significant stress, anxiety, and financial hardship. I believe this error has negatively impacted my credit score and has disadvantaged me in securing future credit or financial opportunities. 

I am requesting that your institution and these credit bureaus take immediate action to correct this mistake and update the status of my account to reflect the correct information. I also expect written confirmation from your institution and the credit bureaus involved to acknowledge the correction. 

The attachment below shows all three credit bureaus showing wrong and different late payments status. 

I urge you to take this complaint seriously and take immediate action to rectify the situation. I hope to hear from you soon with a resolution to this issue. 

Sincerely, XXXX XXXX",None,"EQUIFAX, INC.",NY,11426,None,Consent provided,Web,03/24/23,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,6744967
