03/18/24,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Information belongs to someone else,"RE : You Violated The United States Code Law 15 U.S. Code 1681b - Permissible purposes of consumer reports ( a ) In general Subject to subsection ( c ), any consumer reporting agency may furnish a consumer report under the following circumstances and no other : ( 2 ) In accordance with the written instructions of the consumer to whom it relates.

Under 15 U.S. Code 1681b Permissible purposes of consumer reports I never gave you any written consent to report anything on my consumer report.

As a consumer by law these accounts on this letter must be deleted immediately or i will seek monetary damages in small claims court in my city and state. Also we already involved and sent this letter to the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau, Attorney Generals Office, XXXX XXXX XXXX and Federal Trade Commission. 
1. Under 15 U.S. Code 1681e ( b ) and 15 U.S. Code 1681i ( 5 ) this account is in violation and not reporting accurate. 
XXXX Account XXXX : XXXX Please delete from my credit report immediately 2. Under 15 U.S. Code 1681e ( b ) and 15 U.S. Code 1681i ( 5 ) this account is in violation and not reporting accurate. 
XXXX XXXX XXXX  Account Number : XXXX Please delete from my credit report immediately Sincerely, XXXX XXXX XXXX : XXXX XXXX Assistant Director of Enforcement Consumer Financial Protection BureauXXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX CC : XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX : Consumer Financial Protection Bureau CC : Attorney General 's Office CC : State Senate CC : Federal Deposit Insurance Corporation CC : Controller of the Currency CC : Federal Reserve System CC : Credit and Insurance CC : Federal Trade Commission CC : State Regulatory Agency Please see the attached file.",Company has responded to the consumer and the CFPB and chooses not to provide a public response,"TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.",NY,11221,None,Consent provided,Web,03/18/24,Closed with non-monetary relief,Yes,N/A,8568730
