03/20/24,Credit card,General-purpose credit card or charge card,"Other features, terms, or problems",Other problem,"On XX/XX/2024, I filed a complaint regarding Synchrony Bank ( Complaint ID # XXXX XXXX ) with respect to this bank and their policy regarding e-statements. I would like this to be added to that complaint. ( I did not see a way to 'add ' to it. ) In an effort not to make this longer than it needs to be, I ask that you please refer to the complaint ID listed above for more information regarding the legalities I found re e-statements. Thank you in advance. ) I just received an email ( attached ) from Synchrony stating they have switched my paper statements to online e-statements. The email states if I want paper statements need to go online dn take action. I believe this is in violation as credit card companies can not make e-statements a default, nor cn they coerce or force a consumer to get e-statements. The manner in which a consumer get their statements is up to the consumer -- not the credit card company. 
