10/19/22,Vehicle loan or lease,Lease,Problems at the end of the loan or lease,Unable to receive car title or other problem after the loan is paid off,"In XXXXXXXX XXXX  XXXX I leased the car from XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX NY ). The leasing company would be Kia Finance, Account Number available upon request.

At this time, Kia Finance would be the title holder. 

XXXXXXXX XXXX XXXXXXXX I had completed a lease buyout through XXXX XXXX, Account Available upon request. 


I called XXXX XXXX customer service to request a duplicate title. They had told me that since XXXX received the title, I would have to request a duplicate from them/have XXXX request from the DMV. 

Reached out to XXXX, they had advised that they never received the title. They suggested that Kia orders it. XXXX has never received the original title and had therefore not been able to file on my behalf. 

Ive contacted Kia Finance multiple times and requested to speak to their supervisors. Neither the representatives or supervisors were willing to order a duplicate. Nearly every rep had said that since the title was sent to XXXX, they would have to put the request through. 

This went back and forth for about three months. A supervisor at XXXX was in direct contact with me. She had believed Kia was going to request a duplicate from the DMV. This ended up never being requested and XXXX has not responded to my last three status requests.

Kia Finance has now refused multiple times to send me or XXXX a duplicate copy as they believe they are not the Title Holders. 

Ive attempted to have XXXX XXXX Kia request a copy. The first time I went in, a representative gave me an Odometer statement to submit to Kia Finance. She claimed this would correct the title issue. Nothing was every confirmed to be received and no updates were made to my title. 

I visited the dealership a second time and was told that since it was the end of the month, they were unable to assist me. I scheduled a follow up for XXXX. 
When I went back in, the title/billing representative had said she would request the title from Kia Finance directly/her contact there. I followed up a week later as I didnt hear anything and was told that Kia Finance had not responded.

Ive reached out to Kia Corporate as well. That was shooed away and they did not seem to understand the situation. 


I also had filed a complaint with XXXX XXXX XXXX and had just recently requested to keep the case open. Kia has never reached out to me regarding this. 
File number available upon request I've now had to hire an attorney to draft a demand letter as well as file this complaint.",Company has responded to the consumer and the CFPB and chooses not to provide a public response,HYUNDAI CAPITAL AMERICA,NY,142XX,None,Consent provided,Web,10/19/22,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,6097420
