( 2 )

Designation of loans Loans made to borrowers under this part that, except as otherwise specified in this part, have the same terms, conditions, and benefits as loans made to borrowers under ( A ) section 1078 of this title shall be known as Federal Direct Stafford Loans ; ( B ) section 10782 of this title shall be known as Federal Direct PLUS Loans ; ( C ) section 10783 of this title shall be known as Federal Direct Consolidation Loans ; and ( D ) section 10788 of this title shall be known as Federal Direct Unsubsidized Stafford Loans.

