03/13/24,Mortgage,Reverse mortgage,Struggling to pay mortgage,"Trying to communicate with the company to fix an issue related to modification, forbearance, short sale, deed-in-lieu, bankruptcy, or foreclosure","My house was severely damaged by fire, In XX/XX/XXXX. Since then, I no longer have the single rental income that I was dependent on to help me in paying my Reverse Mortgage obligations ( Retaxes, Insurance, Water/sewer ). I am a XXXX old, XXXX man living on my Social Security Income. My Insurance Company denied my claim and I have filed suit against them in Federal Court. The decision is scheduled for XX/XX/XXXX. 
Since the fire, I have met all my obligations, yet my Loan Servicer, Plaza Mortgage foreclosed on my property, because I had not fully paid my insurance. I borrowed the money to meet the Insurance payment and the foreclose is temporally removed. Since I depleted all my savings to meet my mortgage expenses, I now find myself unable to meet any of my mortgage expenses on time. Although my mortgage holder is aware of my current situation they continue to harass and threaten me with foreclosure. I am a very sick man and this pressure from Plaza Mortgage is having a profound effect on my health, I have since learned that Mortgage servicers like Plaza, employ tactics and impose illegal charges on individuals like myself. I am seeking the assistance of CFPB, as I try to keep only asset I have, my home. Please let me know where I can seek help ( financial or other ). 
Meanwhile, I can only watch as the inflated interest rates literally rip the value out of my house. Because I have a adjustable interest rate for the past two years is over 12 %. 
