der, which has no actual bases due to The Plaintiff being victimized through the use of XXXX and XXXX XXXX XXXXe by said institutions ' employees that he was a stereotypical XXXX male in an attempt to force The Plaintiff to turn to a life of crime and get killed by Police. As similar as Germanys reporting Jews during the XXXX said institutions would treat The Plaintiff as if he was a criminal XXXX boy and in the wrong despite having records of their employees exhibiting the XXXX and discriminatory actions. The Plaintiff would intentionally and deliberately be insulted by said institutions ' employees time and time again in an attempt to force him to lose access to his account and end up destitute. Said Institutions would knowingly, intentionally, and deliberately side with their wrong employees and attempt to destitute The Plaintiff.",Company has responded to the consumer and the CFPB and chooses not to provide a public response,WELLS FARGO & COMPANY,NY,10466,None,Consent provided,Web,07/13/23,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,7244436
