XXXX XXXX XXXX must provide the necessary documentation to verify the accuracy and fairness of the reported information, Including a formal request through the CFPB legal process through complaint number XXXX. This lack of transparency and cooperation is unacceptable and compounds the severity of the situation. By XXXX XXXX  XXXX refinancing the home equity loan without obtaining consent from each owner, the lender disregards the property rights of the individuals involved. This contradicts the spirit of the constitutional provision, which aims to protect homeowners ' interests in their properties, and violates Property Rights. I am officially requesting that XXXX XXXX  XXXX provide all the documentation under the Fair Credit Reporting Act and for XXXX and TransUnion, as XXXX XXXX  XXXX fails to provide the requested documentation to verify the accuracy and fairness of the reporting. Under the doctrine of estoppel by silence, XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX, I may presume that no proof of the alleged debt, nor therefore any such debt exists, and the fraudulent credit report item should be removed from the credit report.",Company has responded to the consumer and the CFPB and chooses not to provide a public response,"TRANSUNION INTERMEDIATE HOLDINGS, INC.",NY,113XX,Servicemember,Consent provided,Web,03/14/24,Closed with non-monetary relief,Yes,N/A,8535908
