the branch couldn't provide me any information in regards as to guy my account was force. i called costumer service again as i was still in the branch and they told me i would have to wait 24 hrs for my account to be available in order to have access to my account they issued me a new card which i got. i called costumer service to active because i couldn't log in the app and they told me they couldn't activate my account because my account is froze. ONCE AGAIN. 
