04/02/24,Credit card,General-purpose credit card or charge card,Closing your account,Company closed your account,"I was told, essentially, that my account was closed because of returned payments. Returned payments at the past had been at Wells Fargo own direction. I said that I made a mistake, and they told me to cal my bank and stop payment. I was simply following Well 's Fargo directions. Then this month I had a returned payment while I was overseas and in the hospital. I had no idea there was an issue with my payment and bank account. I want my account reopened. I do not want to apply for a new card. My account never should have been closed. I am disgusted with how I have been treated by your company. I have called multiple times to have this resolved, but your bankers have been completely unable to help me. In addition, I am willing to pay off the balance in full on the condition that my account is reopened or a new account is immediately reopened in my name. I will not reapply again, because my account should never have been closed. And please don't hide behind the excuse that "" Wells Fargo can close an account for any reason ''. I don't care. I've spent thousands on this card and made many successful payments. I can pay off the balance in full, but my credit card or a new credit card better be reopened. To be treated this way, it is clear to me why so many people avoid well Fargo.",Company has responded to the consumer and the CFPB and chooses not to provide a public response,WELLS FARGO & COMPANY,NY,11206,None,Consent provided,Web,04/02/24,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,8679482
