03/07/24,Checking or savings account,Other banking product or service,Managing an account,Deposits and withdrawals,"Regarding a promotional bonus that was advertised when I opened a Chase Total checking account and a savings account.

Upon opening these accounts with chase, I was informed of a promotional offer that included the following bonuses : A bonus of {$300.00} for opening a Chase Total checking account and having a direct deposit post to the account within 90 days. 
A bonus of {$200.00} for opening a Chase savings account and depositing {$15000.00} or more in new money within 30 days, maintaining a balance of {$15000.00} for 90 days. 
An additional {$400.00} bonus when completing both of the above bonuses. 
I am pleased to confirm that I have met all the terms and conditions required to qualify for these bonuses. 
Specifically : I opened a Chase Total checking account and had a direct deposit post to the account within the specified 90-day period. 
I also opened a Chase savings account, deposited {$15000.00} in new funds within 30 days, and maintained the required balance for the following 90 days. 
Despite fulfilling all the requirements for the promotional bonuses, I have not yet received the additional {$400.00} bonus as promised. I contacted a XXXX who assured me that the promotion would be honored, yet the bonus has not been credited to my account. 

I would greatly appreciate your assistance in resolving this matter and ensuring that I receive the full bonus amount as advertised. If there are any additional steps I need to take or if further documentation is required, please let me know so that I can provide the necessary information promptly.",None,JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.,NY,10704,None,Consent provided,Web,03/07/24,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,8490634
