08/02/24,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Improper use of your report,Reporting company used your report improperly,"Equifax can not provide evidence that I consented to them reporting my non-public information, transaction history and that I gave up my federal rights to opt-out and to my personal privacy. 

