ID # XXXX Request was made to reverse the late fees and interest during the timeline of mis-mailed statements. So far only XX/XX/XXXX and XX/XX/XXXX were waived despite repeated attempts to call in a request for approval. Confirmation # XXXX Please reverse these determinations and fees on my account immediately. I am a long time XXXX customer and have a track record.",Company has responded to the consumer and the CFPB and chooses not to provide a public response,"CITIBANK, N.A.",NY,11216,None,Consent provided,Web,05/16/22,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,5565603
03/19/24,Prepaid card,General-purpose prepaid card,Trouble using the card,Trouble using the card to spend money in a store or online,"I was issued Delta choice rewards in exchange for bumping XXXX flights on flight XXXX on XX/XX/23. The credit was {$12000.00} ( {$3000.00} per ticket x 4 tickets ), issued to one email address since it was one reservation. I redeemed the rewards for Amex rewards gift cards ( 24 cards at {$500.00} each ) on XX/XX/23. 

I attempted to use the Amex cards multiple times and each time it fails. In fact, I have been unable to successfully charge even a single thing. I have tried at different vendors on different cards at different times- each time at a vendor that accepts Amex, where the charge is under the limit of the card value, and is correctly input. Each time, it fails. 

I contacted Amex at least 10 times by phone and also at least 20 - 30 times by email ( documentation included in this case ). Overall, I have been spun in circles : Amex would either be unresponsive or give non-answers stating that the cards worked or would share the instructions on how to use the card which I followed every time. At XXXX point, they asked for proof by sending screenshots of failed transactions, which I did. 

This has gone on since XXXX- all of which while there is a six month expiration that is getting closer-and-closer to expiring daily ( expires in XXXX ) and no ability to use the cards along the way. So {$12000.00} in cards and XXXX ability to spend it. 

In the attached documentation, Amex even shared the records on one of the cards that showed multiple attempts made and zero charged since it failed every time. At one point, I demanded to void the cards and reissue- they agreed, but then responses were as if that was never offered and emails reverted back to the same non-answers, instructions, and spinning in circles. The cards are impossible to use, literally, and Amex has given no solution in three months - while there is an expiration in XXXX and I will lose the money for no fault of my own. 

I feel scammed and would like a check for the {$12000.00} that I currently have in Amex gift cards and have been entirely unable to use - that Amex has received proof of and have also confirmed does not work ( in the attached documentation ).",None,AMERICAN EXPRESS COMPANY,NY,10025,None,Consent provided,Web,03/19/24,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,8570636
