The XXXX  time they told me that I was indeed issued a credit from the merchant - which was not untrue except the credit had nothing to do with the dispute ( it was the difference between the hold put on my card when I picked up the car and the actual charges incurred when I dropped it off ) and was clear if they looked at the detailed invoice I sent them. 

