03/07/24,Prepaid card,General-purpose prepaid card,Trouble using the card,Trouble using the card to spend money in a store or online,"I bought an American Express gift card for {$200.00} on XX/XX/XXXX. I used the card to make a transaction for the first time on XX/XX/XXXX and the transaction went through. I am now reading online that other customers had the same experience as me with these Amex gift cards where they are able to make a transaction with the card the first time and then never again. This has been my experience. The first transaction was for {$10.00}. I've made XXXX transactions since and they have all declined. I called the customer service number on the back of the card every time the card declined and the representative always advised me the same way "" try again in 24 hours ''. They said it was declined for security measures and that they will lift them so that I can make the transaction again the following day. The first declined transaction was on XX/XX/XXXX ( for {$30.00} ), I tried again XX/XX/XXXX, declined ; I called Amex customer support ( which I'm learning is really a company called XXXX XXXX  that Amex outsources their gift card customer service to ) and told them about the decline, they said again to try again in 24 hours, I did, it declined and I called back. They told me to try a different vendor. I tried paying with the card on a different online vendor on XX/XX/XXXX ( for {$35.00} ). It declined. I called the customer service # on the back of the card AGAIN. They told me that the card can not be used for "" fabric and notions vendors ''???? I told them that no one accepts this card and that I would like my money back since I can not use this product. The representative froze my card, took down my personal information, opened a case, gave me a case # and told me to call back in 3 weeks to follow up on the case. I called back on XX/XX/XXXX. The rep told me that I had called too soon and advised me to call back on XX/XX/XXXX. I called back to follow up on XX/XX/XXXX and was told that after an "" investigation '' my refund request was declined and that the only thing to be done was to unfreeze my card and for me to try using it with other vendors. After arguing that I did not want to try with other vendors as it is especially embarrassing to have your credit card declined in-store, I agreed to have my card returned to active. I tried to make an XXXX purchase with the card on XX/XX/XXXX ( for {$86.00} ) and the card declined again. I called the customer service number again and asked for a refund, they told me to call back in 3 days. They refused to give me any information in writing by mail or email so i am not hopeful. I want my money credited back to the credit card I used to purchase the gift card or a refund check sent to me for the remaining amount that I can not spend using this card. There is {$180.00} still on this card that I want returned to me and I never want to deal with credit card gift cards again.",None,AMERICAN EXPRESS COMPANY,NY,XXXXX,None,Consent provided,Web,03/07/24,Closed with monetary relief,Yes,N/A,8490911
