03/21/24,Checking or savings account,Checking account,Closing an account,Company closed your account,"I am writing a complaint to Capital One. My account in Capital One was blocked after an unsuccessful transaction from my main bank account from XXXX XXXX XXXX in XXXX days. 
I opened my main bank account ( checking account ) on XXXX XXXX in Capital One. After that, the bank app gave an option to transfer directly to the Capital One account from another bank through direct deposit. I wrote my account number and routing number. The transaction was successful. I saw this transaction in the Capital One app on XX/XX/XXXX. But after XXXX days on XX/XX/XXXX I got a message on my e-mail from Capital One that XXXX XXXX XXXX refused the transaction. I called to the XXXX XXXX XXXX customer service. The woman explained that I wrote the routing number for wires in the Capital One app, not for the electronic transaction and XXXX for making the transfer. At the same time, she said that she said could not see that the transaction was done. I opened the XXXX XXXX XXXX app I could not see that transaction either. In the Capital One account, it showed that the money got deposited into my account and after the XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX took it back. After the call from Capital One, they contacted me and asked for the address ( I was in the process of changing the address I said the new one and the previous address ). After the small decision, they blocked my account without saying the reason. 
I called Capital One again, asking the reason why my bank account was blocked account they couldn't say anything. 
The day after I called 2 times to customer help and on the second time the woman provided the investigation e-mail of the bank. I explained this situation to the investigation office of the bank and they wrote to me in XXXX days : "" Thanks for your patience while we reviewed unusual activity on XXXX or more of your accounts. We finished our investigation and found there was no suspicious activity. You now have complete access to your Capital One account ( XXXX ). Youll need to request a new debit card, which you can do online or through the Capital One XXXX app ''. 
I entered the app again and I saw that my checking account is still blocked. 
I thought ok, maybe I can open a new account. I tried to open an account XXXX  times and I got these messages : "" We declined your application because your XXXX XXXX XXXX  deposit account score is XXXX ( on a scale of XXXX ), which we consider to be a higher risk score. 
According to XXXX XXXX XXXX, these are the major factors impacting your score '' I got blocked by mistake. This bank mistake will affect my reputation when I open the bank account again. 
I am looking forward to your letter, Thanks for your help",None,CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION,NY,11230,None,Consent provided,Web,03/21/24,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,8584644
