03/09/24,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Improper use of your report,Reporting company used your report improperly,"As a vigilant guardian of my own privacy, I invoke the power vested in me by the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ) and the Fair Debt Collection Practices Act ( FDCPA ) to address the violations concerning my personal information. The FCRA, under 15 U.S.C. 1681 section 602 ( a ), mandates consumer reporting agencies to handle their significant responsibilities with fairness, impartiality, and respect for my right to privacy. XXXX and XXXX, as consumer reporting agencies, must heed this directive. 
I assert my right to ensure that my private information remains confidential, a right that is fortified by 15 U.S.C. 6801, which clearly states that financial institutions have an ongoing obligation to honor the privacy of their customers. The entity that furnishes information to credit agencies falls under this definition and thus, is bound by these laws.

Furthermore, 15 U.S.C. 1681 section 604 ( a ) ( 2 ) specifies that a consumer reporting agency may furnish a report only with my written consent, which neither XXXX, XXXX, nor the furnisher of information has obtained from me. I hereby revoke any form of consent previously granted, whether verbal, non-verbal, written, implied, or otherwise. 
The law is clear in 15 U.S.C. 6802 ( b ) that a financial institution can not disclose my nonpublic personal information to a nonaffiliated third party without informing me of my right to nondisclosure, a right that was never presented to me.

Moreover, 15 U.S.C. 1681C ( a ) ( 5 ) prohibits the reporting of any adverse information older than seven years, which includes the account in question. This is a violation of my legal rights, as there is no permission granted on my part for such reporting.

The accuracy of information is paramount, as stated in 15 U.S.C. 1681s2 ( A ) ( 1 ) ( A ), which forbids the furnishing of information to consumer reporting agencies if it is known or suspected to be inaccurate. XXXX and XXXX failure to maintain reasonable procedures, as required by 15 U.S.C. 1681e, to prevent such violations further compounds the issue.

Lastly, in accordance with 12 CFR 1016.7, I exercise my right to opt out of your reporting services at this time. My privacy is not a commodity for trade, and I demand the respect and confidentiality that is rightfully mine. 
Please be advised that this notice of my rights has been issued to you multiple times and has been met with disregard. This persistent neglect is not only disrespectful but also a clear breach of the legal obligations outlined above. I insist on immediate compliance with these regulations, and any further inaction will be met with the necessary legal recourse to protect my rights.",None,PORTFOLIO RECOVERY ASSOCIATES INC,NY,10462,None,Consent provided,Web,03/09/24,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,8506283
05/10/24,Credit card,Store credit card,"Advertising and marketing, including promotional offers",Confusing or misleading advertising about the credit card,"I would like this complaint sent to the Office Of the Presidents at Macys.

I reported a verifiable issue to which I recorded a few of my issues with Citi and Macy 's. My issue was with Citi.. but, since XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX executive team chose to lie in a response. I've chosen to follow-up with a truthful response since hers lacked integrity like the rest of the company.

On two occasions I didn't pay my Bill.. once when XXXX, and the other when my contract ended with Macy 's and I had to get XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX So I thought it best I pay for what would help me live first.. 

In XXXX NOT XXXX I received the offer for settlement. I called asked to speak to a XXXX at. CITI and got told one would call me back. No one called me back from Citi recovery.. In XXXX I called back and got told my account was back with Macy 's I said Macys said it was with recovery... They said No Macys took the account back to review.. I said ok so how to I settle this account can I get a manager and as usually they hung up. I then get the harassing calls again.. I answer say hello hello no one answers I hang up call back I get a prompt that my social doesn't work in... or zip ( have a recording )... I dial XXXX and I get a rude rep... I ask for a manager .. get hung up on by Citi.. I call back ask for a manager.. this process of calling ( cold call proceeds and in XXXX I get the same harassing calls.. I call back and decide Im tire of being harassed and asked for my FULLLLL social which I recorded a manager saying they aren't supposed to ask for that first.. I get a rude rep I tell him how much can I pay he makes it clear id have to pay the full amount. I said can I pay a payment plan minimum XXXX he said NO the system will tell me the minimum you can pay .. he seemed uninterested in doing this.. he Tells me your first payment will be XXXX and then XXXX after each month.. he said you will have to listen to a script in order for you to pay.. I said ok and I agree. I check my account XXXX removed .... weeks later I get harassing cold calls ( I recorded ).. I get hung up on, told my account isn't with them, or yelled at saying let them assist and I can't speak to a manager and have to pay that I have no payment plan.. I said that's impossible. they get me a manager... She says clear as day ... the representative did not complete the process... Now I found that impossible because I read the agreed to a script over phone for this...

She THE MANAGER says she will investigate and she will see what she can do about my original settlement and interest .. BECAUSe OF THE SERVICES ISSUES... I make a XXXX  complaint and a CFPB complaint on CITI ... and XXXX XXXX responds .. with false occurrences..",Company has responded to the consumer and the CFPB and chooses not to provide a public response,"CITIBANK, N.A.",NY,11434,None,Consent provided,Web,05/15/24,Closed with non-monetary relief,Yes,N/A,8970162
