03/13/24,Credit card,General-purpose credit card or charge card,"Advertising and marketing, including promotional offers",Confusing or misleading advertising about the credit card,"Subject : Complaint Regarding Misleading Information and Feeling Misled by XXXX XXXX Application Process - this offered was made base on my original current card # XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX with a credit limit of {$300.00} dollars from a destinycard.com Dear to whom it may concern, I am writing to express my deep disappointment and frustration regarding my recent experience with the Milestone Mastercard application process. Upon receiving communication from your company indicating that I was eligible for a {$1000.00} limit Milestone Mastercard, I proceeded to apply with high hopes and expectations. 

However, upon completing the application and receiving the card, I was shocked and dismayed to discover that the credit limit provided was denied and lowered my credit I was working so hard to improve. I even called XXXX XXXX credit reporting agency to remove the freeze to allow for the processing of the application. This discrepancy has left me feeling misled, cheated, and as if I have fallen victim to a scam. 

The information provided during the application process led me to believe that I would be approved for a {$1000.00} credit limit, which was a significant factor in my decision to apply for the Milestone Mastercard. To discover that this was not the case after going through the entire application process has left me feeling deceived and betrayed by XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX  pursuant to license from MasterCard international phone number XXXX. 

As a customer, I expect transparency and honesty from the companies with which I do business. The misleading information provided by your company has not only damaged my trust in your brand but has also resulted in a negative financial impact for me. 

I urge you to investigate this matter promptly and provide me with a satisfactory resolution. This may include honoring the originally promised credit limit, providing compensation for the inconvenience and disappointment caused, or taking steps to ensure that future communication with customers is clear, accurate, and transparent. 

I appreciate your attention to this matter and look forward to a prompt resolution. 

Sincerely, XXXX XXXX - ( XXXX ) XXXX - XXXX - email : XXXX XXXX",None,"CLGF Holdco 1, LLC",NY,10990,None,Consent provided,Web,03/15/24,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,8537568
