04/30/24,Student loan,Federal student loan servicing,Dealing with your lender or servicer,Problem with customer service,"Mohela 1. Requested Student Loan Debt Forbearance : Received letter dated XX/XX/XXXX asking for payment Called to ask process for submitting an application online. 
