XXXX. Called XX/XX/XXXX spoke with XXXX XXXX everything XXXX said Forbearance takes 78 business days. Your application was sent on XX/XX/XXXX ; therefore, 78 business days from that date. 
I reiterated that I was told an Admin Forbearance is a total of 18 months. My first ended on XX/XX/XXXX ; however I was not given 6 months. The second on was given in XXXX and ended in XXXX again that was not 6 months. I said I have one left. If it is supposed to be 18 months then it should end XX/XX/XXXX. 
XXXX told me he couldnt do anything because the scope of support doesnt include forbearance and this was just updated recently. 
He told me he was forwarding my call to XXXX  After he transferred me the wait time was 57 minutes and I requested a call back. ( It is now XX/XX/XXXX and I am still waiting!!! ) 6. Called Mohela on XX/XX/XXXX selected XXXX. The wait time was 532 minutes = 8.8 hours. I tried several times to set up a call back but was disconnected. 

7. Called again on XX/XX/XXXX and again a ridiculous wait time. 

8. Called XX/XX/XXXX spoke with XXXX. She explained that XXXX is just like Mohela. Loans were disbursed to Mohela, XXXX, etc. 

I am receiving a number of emails telling me I need to Take Action on my loans.

