04/02/24,"Money transfer, virtual currency, or money service",Virtual currency,Money was not available when promised,None,"Over a year ago, I completed all required steps for identity verification with Coinbase, anticipating this would grant me full access to their services. Despite fulfilling every requirement and providing all necessary documentation promptly, my account verification remains incomplete to this day. 

Since completing the verification steps in about XXXX, XXXX, I have engaged in multiple attempts to address and resolve this delay with Coinbase. My most recent effort to seek clarity and assistance was on XX/XX/XXXX, which, like previous attempts, yielded no progress or resolution. Disturbingly, following my latest inquiry, I found my access to Coinbase 's customer support channels unexpectedly restricted, further limiting my ability to resolve this issue. 

This protracted delay and the subsequent restriction on my customer service access have significantly impacted my ability to utilize Coinbase 's platform effectively. It appears to me that this delay in completing the verification process, despite my compliance with all requirements, is intentional. The lack of communication and the decision to limit my access to support services have only compounded my concerns, leaving me with serious doubts about Coinbase 's commitment to customer service and transparency. 

Given the critical nature of timely access and management of assets within the volatile cryptocurrency market, this delay poses potential risks to my financial well-being. It is with these considerations in mind that I am compelled to seek the intervention of the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau ( CFPB ) to facilitate a resolution. My hope is that with your assistance, Coinbase will address and rectify the verification delay, restore my access to customer support, and allow me to engage fully with their platform once more.",None,"Coinbase, Inc.",NY,13210,None,Consent provided,Web,04/02/24,Closed with monetary relief,Yes,N/A,8667395
