ervices XXXX XXXX XXXX acct XXXX who is charging interest/action against me for the stated sum.",Company believes it acted appropriately as authorized by contract or law,MOHELA,NY,128XX,Servicemember,Consent provided,Web,10/25/23,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,7754518
