NSTAR/COOPER XXXX XXXX 

I wish to highlight that this late account entry is inaccurate, and I firmly believe it violates the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ). I have already contacted the other credit bureaus- XXXX and XXXX - regarding this issue, and they promptly updated their reports to reflect the accurate information. 

The account in question has been fully paid off, and there is no remaining balance, as evidenced by the documentation and records provided. Despite my attempts to rectify this error, it appears that your agency has not complied with the law by persisting to report this inaccurate information. 

