03/19/24,Vehicle loan or lease,Lease,Incorrect information on your report,Information belongs to someone else,"I am writing to bring to your urgent attention a critical issue concerning my credit report. Upon reviewing it, I have discovered fraudulent account that do not belong to me. I formally dispute the presence of this unauthorized account and request their immediate and aggressive removal from my credit report. As a victim of identity theft, I am perplexed as to why the CRA is not complying with the law, especially when the other bureaus have done so. I have provided supporting documentation, including a copy of my identity document, and any other relevant materials, to substantiate the claim that this account is a result of identity theft or fraudulent activity. The fraudulent account in question : ALLY FINANCIAL XXXX. 

Recognizing the importance of your role in maintaining accurate and reliable credit information, I urge you to swiftly and aggressively investigate and remove this fraudulent account from my credit report. It is crucial that these unauthorized entries be deleted as soon as possible to prevent further damage to my credit score and financial standing. I appreciate your understanding of the urgency surrounding this matter and request your prompt attention in resolving this dispute. I hereby request that you initiate an immediate investigation into this fraudulent account and provide me with the results as soon as possible. I expect that you will take all necessary actions to promptly delete these entries, ensuring the accuracy and integrity of my credit report. Thank you for your prompt attention to this matter. I eagerly anticipate a swift resolution and the removal of the fraudulent account from my credit report.",Company has responded to the consumer and the CFPB and chooses not to provide a public response,ALLY FINANCIAL INC.,NY,11570,None,Consent provided,Web,03/19/24,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,8580459
