05/10/23,"Money transfer, virtual currency, or money service",Mobile or digital wallet,"Managing, opening, or closing your mobile wallet account",None,"Dear PayPal Customer Service, I am writing to appeal the permanent limitation on my PayPal account, which I believe was placed in error. My PayPal account email address is XXXX Firstly, I strongly believe that this limitation was placed in error, as I have not violated any PayPal policies. I have always used my account in accordance with PayPal 's terms and conditions, and I have never engaged in any fraudulent or illegal activities. Therefore, I respectfully request that PayPal re-examine my case and consider restoring my account. 

Secondly, I would like to emphasize that I have always complied with PayPal 's policies and guidelines. I have never engaged in any activities that would warrant a permanent limitation on my account. I have always provided accurate information and have always conducted my transactions in good faith. As such, I am deeply troubled by the limitation placed on my account and would like to ask PayPal to review my account history to confirm that I have always been a responsible PayPal user. 

Lastly, I would like to request that PayPal re-investigate my case and consider restoring my account if possible. I value the services that PayPal provides, and I would like to continue using them in the future. Therefore, I would greatly appreciate it if PayPal would reconsider my case and restore my account. 

Thank you for taking the time to review my appeal. I look forward to hearing back from PayPal soon. 

Sincerely, XXXX XXXX",None,"Paypal Holdings, Inc",NY,11103,None,Consent provided,Web,05/10/23,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,6956926
