03/08/24,Debt or credit management,Debt settlement,Charged upfront or unexpected fees,None,"i have been with FDR since XX/XX/2022. Since then they have collected {$4300.00} which i belive was mismanaged. i had active XXXX settlements but when i called to change my withdrawl date to align with my pay date my settlements were cancelled. i called and spoke with a supervisor and was advised they would pull the call and if the rep didnt advise that my settlements would be cancelled, everything would be reinstated. i havent heard back from this supervisor ( that communicated thru XXXX XXXX ). i called again and spoke with XXXX whom asked for her to lookinto this and never got back to me. I called again and spoke with XXXX XXXX whom was going to look into this. She did get back to me and had one account reinstated. When i looked into how much money was taken and questioned the fees, she advised there was an error and would fix it. i also asked for an itemized statement to which went unanswered. This process was over a months time. i now called to cancel the program as not one supervisor has followed up. i was advised upon termination that they would take out their additional funds and refund the balance which looks lik {$95.00}. Even if they charged me for the settlement fees of 25 % it would come to {$2200.00} which was supposed to be taken over time. so a year and a half later, i am {$4300.00} further inthe hole, not one settlement completed but the company made a nice profit off of me for no services completed.",None,FREEDOM FINANCIAL NETWORK,NY,117XX,None,Consent provided,Web,03/12/24,Closed with monetary relief,Yes,N/A,8502651
