04/10/24,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Account information incorrect,I do not have an open credit card with Capital one bank nor a card in my possession. I am listed credit report for having open credit card account with Capital One bank with over XXXX balance. Have no knowledge of this card nor did i ever authorize or open a credit card with them nor charge or owe a debt or balance in this amount. Have XXXX closed capital one credit card with {$570.00} balance that i currently owe and am making payments on. My name is XXXX XXXX XXXX and it shows a card opened with my address and social however in a fraudulent last name. I am not nor claim to be XXXX XXXX and do not have a card in this name nor have i ever used opened or had access to this account.,None,CAPITAL ONE FINANCIAL CORPORATION,NY,XXXXX,None,Consent provided,Web,04/15/24,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,8744916
04/10/24,Credit reporting or other personal consumer reports,Credit reporting,Incorrect information on your report,Account information incorrect,"To Whom It May Concern, I am writing to formally dispute the accuracy and legality of the information contained in my credit reports with XXXX, XXXX, and XXXX, as provided under the provisions of 15 USC 1681 regarding the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FCRA ). 
Upon reviewing my credit reports, I have discovered that there are entries indicating that you have furnished my information to third parties and obtained information about me. However, I want to emphasize that I have never provided written consent for you to furnish my information to any third party or to obtain information about me from any source. 

I am aware that under the FCRA, it is required that consumer reporting agencies such as yours obtain written consent from consumers before furnishing their information to third parties or obtaining information about them. This consent is a fundamental protection afforded to consumers to ensure the accuracy and fairness of the information contained in their credit reports. 

As such, I request that you provide evidence of the written consent that I allegedly provided for you to furnish my information or obtain information about me. If you are unable to provide such evidence, I demand that you remove all entries related to information furnishing and obtaining from my credit reports immediately. 
Please note that failure to comply with this request may result in legal action being taken against your agency for violations of the FCRA. I expect a prompt response to this dispute within 30 days, as required by law. 
Sincerely, XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX, NY XXXX XXXX ( XXXX ) XXXX",None,Resurgent Capital Services L.P.,NY,10009,None,Consent provided,Web,04/10/24,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,8745325
06/06/24,Debt collection,Other debt,Attempts to collect debt not owed,Debt is not yours,"I am writing to bring to your attention a serious matter regarding the unauthorized reporting of debt by the Monterey Collection Company on my credit report. To the best of my knowledge, I have not entered into any agreement with them nor do I owe the amount of {$3100.00} stated in their report. This action has not only caused signification distress but has also violated my rights under the Fair Credit Reporting Act ( FRCA ). 

I kindly request your immediate assistance in rectifying this erroneous reporting and ensuring that my credit report is restored to its accurate and unblemished state. 
Furthermore, I am also seeking remediation for the damages caused by this violation and the impact it has had on my creditworthiness. 

I trust that you will address this matter promptly and provide me with the necessary support to resolve this issue swiftly. I look forward to your prompt response and cooperation in this regard. 

Thank you for your attention to this urgent matter.",Company believes it acted appropriately as authorized by contract or law,Monterey Financial Services LLC,NY,11212,None,Consent provided,Web,06/06/24,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,9183756
