11/13/22,"Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports",Credit reporting,Problem with fraud alerts or security freezes,None,"The web portal to freeze/unfreeze my Equifax credit report ( on my.equifax.com ) does not work half the time. It is XX/XX/22 at XXXX pm eastern and it has not been loading for at least XXXX minutes. There is no error message- it just keeps loading. 

