04/01/24,Credit card,General-purpose credit card or charge card,"Advertising and marketing, including promotional offers",Didn't receive advertised or promotional terms,"I am paying for a high end card the citi prestige card and one of the advertised benefits is the 4th night free 2x a year. You book for 4 nights and pay for 3 nights.

The issue is the prices to receive this paid for benefit with my card are incredibly high. For example, the pattern is that citi is asking me to pay super inflated prices per night to get the 4th night free. This applies for any hotel around the world. This renders the benefit useless. I am paying for a premium card, a heft XXXX a year card and not receiving the benefit. It is a scam. How can I receive the 4th night free if I have to pay 1.5x the price of what is offered on the hotel site directly or ironically with your partner XXXX? It is not a real benefit and highly deceitful. I will not provide tons and tons of examples but search for any example online on the hotel 's website and then compare to the inflated prices on citi.com This is a scam I complained on XXXX, someone called with no authority and left a message. 
