05/06/24,"Payday loan, title loan, personal loan, or advance loan",Personal line of credit,Charged fees or interest you didn't expect,None,"Subject : XXXX XXXX XXXX Barclays for Deceptive Practices I am writing to address a matter of significant concern regarding my recent interaction with Barclays. In the month of XX/XX/XXXX, I applied for a credit offer from Barclays with the understanding that I would be entitled to a {$15000.00} credit balance at XXXX XXXX XXXXXXXX. This offer was extended to me based on my XXXX XXXX, which was above XXXX at the time. 

Enclosed for your reference, you will find the promotional material I received. It prominently highlighted the terms of the offer, including a XXXX XXXX promotional XXXX  through at least XX/XX/XXXX, and a requirement that any balance transfers must be posted by XX/XX/XXXX. However, upon closer inspection, I discovered a XXXX XXXX  "" transfer fee '' in the amount of {$600.00}, associated with this credit amount. This fee was conspicuously absent from any proper disclosure and was notably excluded from the material terms listed above. 

The lack of transparency regarding this fee has left me feeling misled and dissatisfied. Had I been properly informed of this additional charge, I would not have pursued this offer. This omission constitutes a clear violation of fair practices and has caused me financial distress. As a result, I am seeking a full refund of the {$600.00} fee that was not properly disclosed. 

My dissatisfaction is further exacerbated by recent actions taken by the Consumer Financial Protection Bureau ( CFPB ) against other institutions for similar misleading practices due to a failure to provide proper disclosures. 

Despite reaching out to Barclays several times, both via phone and in writing ( twice ), I have received no response or acknowledgment whatsoever regarding the issue outlined above.",Company has responded to the consumer and the CFPB and chooses not to provide a public response,BARCLAYS BANK DELAWARE,NY,XXXXX,None,Consent provided,Web,05/06/24,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,8942691
