07/24/22,"Money transfer, virtual currency, or money service",International money transfer,Other transaction problem,None,"On XX/XX/2022 I made a wire transfer through my CHASE BANK app. I transferred {$380.00} ( XXXX GBP ) to a XXXX bank account and I received a confirmation from CHASE BANK saying that the transfer was completed and the recipient should receive the money within 2-5 business days. 

Since the money was not received by the recipient, I made an inquiry to CHASE on XX/XX/2022, to find out what had happened to the wire transfer and if the money was on its way to the XXXX bank account. 
On the same date, I received a secure message through the CHASE BANK app saying that the wire transfer was not successful and that the money was not delivered to the recipient. CHASE stated that the reason why the transfer was not completed was that the information of the recipient was not complete. 
The secure message stated that the funds were going to be returned to my account within 3 to 5 business days. 

On XX/XX/2022 I contacted CHASE BANK through secure messages on the Mobile bank app because the funds ( {$380.00} ) were never returned to my account. CHASE answered back on XX/XX/2022 stating they did not have the money at their disposal and that they were working with the banks in chain to return the funds as soon as possible. 

On XX/XX/XXXX I contacted CHASE BANK again since I did not have any answer about the money. They answered me back stating that they tried to retrieve the money several times but it was not possible and that I should contact the bank in the XXXX and settle the matter on my own and that the case was closed. 

After this, I have tried to contact them at least once a week asking for a supervisor and for the escalation of my case. The response from CHASE BANK is always that they acknowledge my case and the request for escalation and a supervisor, and that I should be contacted in the following days. However, I have never been contacted. 

I have tried to go to several branches in XXXX XXXX XXXXXXXX, tried calling different customer service numbers, and tried to share my case on social media. The only response that I've gotten so far is that I should send a secure message through the CHASE BANK app and wait for a response. 

I do not know what else do to. CHASE BANK has held {$380.00} from my account since XX/XX/XXXX and nobody has been able to help me.",None,JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.,NY,11216,None,Consent provided,Web,07/24/22,Closed with non-monetary relief,Yes,N/A,5805074
