05/20/22,"Money transfer, virtual currency, or money service",Domestic (US) money transfer,Fraud or scam,None,"On XX/XX/22, I was a victim of identity theft / wire fraud through Citibank. They seem to neglect the fact that I didn't fall victim to a scam, I didn't authorize it whatsoever. I was part of a data breach through XXXX, and a hacker was able to get my identity by stealing the ID # on my XXXX Card. No matter how this happened it was never authorized by ME. They used a burner phone to get ahold of my phone internally. During the process I lost service, so no one could contact me at all, and I had no idea what was occurring. What did occur was that Citibank didn't lock my account, and instead they let a hacker wire out {$26000.00} of my hard earned savings. My account was completely protected through XXXX factor authentication, and still somehow Citibank refuses to give me back my hard earned {$26000.00} even though they're required to through the FDIC. They seem to think that I'll just say goodbye to my money, and that they'll get away with this. I've received now XXXX denial letters ( all with different / bogus reasons as to why I don't deserve MY money back ). I now will be serving them with a lawyer, and won't stop until I have this money back. 

How can you blame a victim of this occurring? I didn't fall victim to a scam, and I didn't fall victim to ever authorizing a hacker to wiring {$26000.00} out of my savings. Citibank doesn't like the fact that I've brought attention to the news with this, but what do you expect? This is mentally and physically draining, but I won't stop after I have my money back. XXXX months now and all I've received is denials and lies. 

Keep in mind that I didn't fall to a scam, I didn't click anything, and no matter how this occurred Citibank is required to give me my hard earned money back.",Company has responded to the consumer and the CFPB and chooses not to provide a public response,"CITIBANK, N.A.",NY,11793,None,Consent provided,Web,05/20/22,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,5583418
