10/27/22,"Money transfer, virtual currency, or money service",Mobile or digital wallet,Fraud or scam,None,"Re : Errors on my checking account Dear M & T Bank, I am writing to request a correction for a dispute placed on XX/XX/2022 in regards to a charge placed on XX/XX/2022 and processed on XX/XX/2022 for {$140.00}. 

