08/17/22,"Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports",Credit reporting,Improper use of your report,Reporting company used your report improperly,"I am a natural person, I am a living human being. I have rights under 15 U.S.C 1681.

Equifax is governed by 15 U.S.C 1681. They have violated my rights numerous times. I demand that these accounts be removed because according to 15 U.S.C 1681 I have the right to privacy and I did not give Equifax written permission to furnish these accounts. These accounts have been litigated and balances reported are incorrect. Both of these accounts have been closed and delinquent past the statutory time allowed to be reported. The company reporting these items hasnt submitted a closing date because it proves that the accounts are in violation of the statutory law. There hasnt been a thorough, reasonable, or fair investigation. If there was these credit bureaus would have noticed the violation and corrected it XXXX recognized the inaccurate information and removed them. Ive submitted enough legal documentation for them to do a fair investigation XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX XXXX  ) are the items in reference",None,"EQUIFAX, INC.",NY,14211,None,Consent provided,Web,08/17/22,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,5888470
09/04/22,Student loan,Federal student loan servicing,Improper use of your report,Reporting company used your report improperly,"I spoke to nelnet XX/XX/2022, I explained to them that I never gave them consent to report late payments to my consumer report. The account manager XXXX responded to me stating that I signed the promissory note opting in to furnish to my consumer report. Nelnet kept telling me pursuant to federal LAW they have to report. I keep requesting where does is state by law? please provide that information. Which NOW I KNOW ITS A lie. They claim that I opted in but nelnet or the depart of Ed never told me that pursuant to 15 usc 6802 B that I had the right to opt out. That was never given to me or disclosed to me. That mean I was not ever given the option to choose. I am requesting to opt out of furnishing late payments so they need to be updated asap. Nelnet keep sending me letters that a credit repair company is the one writing these disputes when it's me. XXXX XXXX XXXX, the NATURAL PERSON.",None,"Nelnet, Inc.",NY,10459,None,Consent provided,Web,09/04/22,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,5946215
