09/10/22,Checking or savings account,Checking account,Managing an account,Fee problem,"Please refer to complaint number XXXX which I filed. 
I do not agree with Upgrade 's response and see below their response. 
Company 's Response Dear XXXX XXXX, Thank you for your correspondence through the CFPB received in our office XX/XX/2022. We are sorry to learn that you were dissatisfied with your experience at Upgrade. On XX/XX/2022, you opened a Rewards Checking account through Upgrade. Please note, a Rewards Checking account is a separate product from an Upgrade Card with a personal line of credit. As of XX/XX/2022, you do not have an Upgrade Card account. In order to have qualified for the {$200.00} welcome bonus, as disclosed in the promotional offer you attached to your complaint : To qualify for the {$200.00} welcome bonus, you must open and fund a new Upgrade Rewards Checking account and make 3 debit card transactions within 60 days of your Upgrade Card account opening. The bonus credit will be posted to your Upgrade Card as a rewards credit within 1-2 billing periods following the third debit transaction on your Rewards Checking account. Your Upgrade Card must be in good standing to receive bonus. As there was no Upgrade Card account opened, you were not eligible to receive the {$200.00} welcome bonus. We apologize for any confusion. As a courtesy to you, if you open an Upgrade Card in the next 30 days, you will be eligible to receive the {$200.00} welcome bonus. If you have any additional questions, please contact our XXXX XXXX team at ( XXXX ) XXXX, Monday through Friday, XXXXpm MST, or email XXXX XXXX XXXX. Sincerely, Upgrade , Inc . 

Please see my response ADDITIONAL COMMENTS HI, The promotional terms are as follows and you can please refer to the attached terms o qualify for the {$200.00} welcome bonus, you must open and fund a new Upgrade Rewards Checking account and make 3 debit card transactions within 60 days of your Upgrade Card account opening. The bonus credit will be posted to your Upgrade Card as a rewards credit within 1-2 billing periods following the third debit transaction on your Rewards Checking account. Your Upgrade Card must be in good standing to receive a bonus. 
I UNDERSTAND THE COMPANYS RESPONSE TO MY COMPLAINT No ADDITIONAL COMMENTS Upgrade states on their response to my complaint an Upgrade Card with a personal line of credit If you look at their terms and conditions it doesn't mention that you have to establish a personal line of credit. They just mention on their official terms that you can get the bonus by opening a rewards checking account and make 3 debit card transaction within 60 days of the Upgrade card account opening which I did. There is no mention on their terms that a personal line of credit has to be opened to get the bonus. 
THE COMPANY DID WHAT THEY SAID THEY WOULD DO WITH MY COMPLAINT No",None,"UPGRADE, INC.",NY,11418,None,Consent provided,Web,09/27/22,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,5967694
