09/30/22,Student loan,Private student loan,Struggling to repay your loan,Can't get other flexible options for repaying your loan,"1- We got a student Loan From Sallie Mae XXXX A federal Institution created by the congress to fund education. this is what we tought when we sign with them in XXXX that it was a government entity that serviced federal education loans. 

