lso wouldn't tell us if they tried to call the wedding guests more than once. Chase closed the account, refunded me the checks written out to me ( for a total of {$2200.00} ), but still over a year later has not refunded the {$3100.00} in checks written to my husband that I tried to deposit because of this theoretical concern of fraud even though we clarified with them that there was no fraud. The issue was ultimately Chase 's mistake because an employee at their XXXX XXXX branch did not register my husband to the account despite verbally telling him that he had. Chase have given us no alternative path to resolution and has told us that there is no one higher in the organization that we can contact. They have held our {$3100.00} for over a year. 

