I called back at XXXXXXXX XXXX. and spoke with a Chase representative, XXXX, for XXXX minutes. I told her what had happened, and she informed me that she couldn't cancel the payments because they had already been delivered ( even though they were still marked "" pending '' ). She would note that I called, and make a courtesy recovery for the purpose of filing a claim with XXXX. They would reach out to XXXX, but, she said that when it comes to personally initiated transactions, there was no guarantee of recovered funds. If we did get the courtesy recovery of funds, it would be from Chase. But she wanted to set my expectations that there was no guarantee of that happening. She also said they would flag XXXX, a Chase customer, to ensure he doesn't blackmail other people ( I gave her the email address we had ). 

