06/25/22,Checking or savings account,Savings account,Managing an account,Funds not handled or disbursed as instructed,"XX/XX/XXXX, I was called that a suspicious person tried to make a withdrawal from my savings account at a bank branch an hour earlier and they wanted to confirm whether it was me. I told them it was not. I asked them to freeze my account and when they went to do so, they realized that another bank location had allowed the person to withdraw {$3000.00} from my savings. Chase froze my account and I had to call claims and go in person to verify it was not me. Chase froze my savings account and opened a new savings account for me and transferred the rest of my savings there. I asked to file a claim and I was told I had to file a police report first. I filed a police report and then attempted to file a claim. They said I had to wait for the police report before going forward with my claim. Then XX/XX/XXXX, a second unauthorized withdrawal occurred in my new savings account of {$2500.00}. I called to dispute this and asked why there were no additional protections made in my account as my account information was already compromised and chase knew this. They told me they didn't have any additional protections for withdrawals at a bank teller. I decided to remove the rest of my money from chase and transferred my funds to a new bank entirely. Since then, Chase has only returned {$2500.00} ( the second withdrawal ). I have called several times to check the updates on the first claim and they continue to stall. They required additional I.D . for the claim of {$3000.00}. I had gone in person and given my passport to input into their system and I still have not received the {$3000.00}. Why they insisted to wait for the police report and require additional I.D . for the first claim and not the second one, I'm not sure. But this is ridiculous. Chase had not properly protected my money when they knew my account information was compromised and also hasn't returned all my money.",None,JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.,NY,11220,None,Consent provided,Web,06/25/22,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,5706919
