s would be closed, and that I could NEVER be a Chase customer again and that they would return whatever funds were available afterwards approximately 10 days when their investigation would be concluded. I was a victim of identity theft ... Chase did not protect or support me as a client. I want my money back.",None,JPMORGAN CHASE & CO.,NY,10543,None,Consent provided,Web,04/11/23,Closed with explanation,Yes,N/A,6822362
