07/29/22,"Credit reporting, credit repair services, or other personal consumer reports",Credit reporting,Improper use of your report,Credit inquiries on your report that you don't recognize,"Dear Team - I want to highlight and escalate an issue I am not receiving any help on. 

Bank involved - Chase Credit agency - XXXX XXXX XX/XX/2022- I applied for a XXXX XXXX Chase Credit Card. And there was a HARD INQUIRY on my credit report XXXX XX/XX/2022- I receive a letter to call Chase as they need some information to continue the review. 

XXXX XX/XX/2022- I called Chase ( phone no - XXXX ) and I was told that they just need to reconfirm some details which will NOT lead to a 2nd credit pull. I re-stated that if they need to re-apply/ re-pull my credit file - I DONOT want the card. this was all on a recorded line. 

